<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="MRK" style="id">- Anu Bible Translation</book>
  <para style="usfm">3.0</para>
  <para style="ide">65001 - Unicode (UTF-8)</para>
  <para style="h">MARKA</para>
  <para style="toc1">Marka Kei ty mih Isu Hkrista hai Satang Hnai</para>
  <para style="toc2">Marka</para>
  <para style="toc3">Mrk</para>
  <para style="mt1">MARKA</para>
  <para style="mt2">Marka Kei ty mih Isu Hkrista hai Satang Hnai</para>
  <para style="imt">Cxk-ri Mih Kly</para>
  <para style="im">
    <char style="bk">Marka Kei ty mih Isu Hkrista hai Satang Hnai</char> ca-uk cy, Nʼhra kly har ca-uk ko hai Isu Hkrista hai hring mih sai hym kei ty mih Satang Hnai ca-uk liu uk long hai uk hlyk na. Mi ca-uk hym cy, “Gospel” Satang Hnai ca-uk pei hpau mina. Mi ca-uk si hym cy Isu hmat htyk mikum Mahtai, Marka, Luka, hak Johan si hmat kei mina. Marka kei ty mih Satang Hnai ca-uk cy, Satang Hnai liu uk long mih lui kyk mih ca-uk uk hlyk na ny, Satang Hnai liu uk mih long kei ty cxk-ri mih ca-uk po na. Mi ca-uk hym cy Isu hkeu mikum <char style="sc">a.d.</char> 65 la hak <char style="sc">a.d.</char> 70 la tare kei ty mih ca-uk na. Mi ca-uk hym cy ve Rom mary mih imi si hym jok hra hym mih kavui patyp kei ty mih na miluk, kei Rom mary hai pei mih kei ca mih sara si hmat cy ta-hmai ty mina.</para>
  <para style="ip">Cinrx Marka pei hpau mih Marka cy Rahmang mih Pawla mija Banaba hai rawi jua po na. Pei miluk hmat cy misi txr Satang Hnai mih jung (Rahm 13.13) hmat hym hjy ty klak miluk ny, hmat hai ming cy tamu hrau mih nokamhtang mina. Marka cy kung hka Banaba hak sxn cyng karawi kai ja pin tym mina (Rahm 15.37–39). Marka hai ca-uk cy Isu hring mihtxm hka kei ty mih nona tok kapo, Petara hai hkai sasi mih sai si hym hmat cy tang ty hmai teng long mih Satang si hym Marka kei mina. Marka hai kei ty mih Satang Hnai ca-uk cy imi si hai kavui hnai kyk mih klysai na pei mih kei baibu mih sara si hmat cy ta-hmai ty va mina. Marka kei ty mih Satang Hnai ca-uk ko kungbxng mih ning hka Isu hai txr riu mih sai si kasxt mih, plau hmat hai tabei mih satang si imi si hkam katxng jok hnaipxng mina.</para>
  <para style="iot">Kahmar jok Mih</para>
  <para style="io1">1. Marka hai kahmar jok mih sai <char style="ior">(<ref loc="MRK 1:1-13">1.1–13</ref>)</char></para>
  <para style="io1">2. Hmat cy ve Kalile pre mihka Isu hai tok hym katxng jok mih sai <char style="ior">(<ref loc="MRK 1:14-8:21">1.14—8.21</ref>)</char></para>
  <para style="io1">3. Isu kai pin Jerusalem mih satang si hym txr tahpong mih sai <char style="ior">(<ref loc="MRK 8:22-10:52">8.22—10.52</ref>)</char></para>
  <para style="io1">4. Isu hmat ve Jerusalem mary mih sai hak Isu htyk mih long hai rx tyng mih satang hym kei ty mihly patxt ty mina <char style="ior">(<ref loc="MRK 11:1-16:8">11.1—16.8</ref>)</char></para>
  <para style="ie" />
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="MRK 1" />
  <para style="s">Baptisma Johan Txrkly Mih</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 3:1-12">Mahtai 3.1–12</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 3:1-18">Luka 3.1–18</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 1:19-28">Johan 1.19–28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 1:1" />Cami cy Tamuk hai Tahi<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1.1 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Kawt mih kei ty rut hly mih ca-uk si luk cy </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Tamuk hai Tahi; </char><char style="ft" closed="false">pei mih klysai hym nokakrum.</char></note> Isu Hkrista hai cxk-ri mih Satang Hnai na. <verse eid="MRK 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 1:2" />Ahmo Isaia kei ty mih cy:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 1:2">“Tamuk hmat, Jau a, ‘Ang cy yn hai hmang mih mʼhma hym py ty yp hym mih ang hai rahmang hym</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MRK 1:2">yn hai ri htang ang hrua hym.’<verse eid="MRK 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 1:3" />Krongci long hai ot nang mih kly txn cy,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MRK 1:3">‘Malai hmang mih mʼhma hym py ty yp vah;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MRK 1:3">hmat hai mʼhma hym patawr vah!’ ” peipa jok mina.<verse eid="MRK 1:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 1:4" />Hnakacy baptisma Johan cy krongci long hai cawn ra ny ho tara mihly py jok baptisma mina.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1.4 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Hnakacy baptisma Johan cy krongci long hai cawn ra ny ho tara mihly py jok baptisma mina; </char><char style="ft" closed="false">kawt mih kei ty rut hly mih ca-uk si luk cy </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Baptisma Johan cy krongci long hai cawn ra ny ho tara mina, </char><char style="ft" closed="false">pei kei ty mina.</char></note> Hmat cy imi si hym, “Kamngo hai hrithmut va ny py va baptisma; pei kacy Tamuk hmat pahlawi jok ynni hai kamngo hym,” peipa jok mina. <verse eid="MRK 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 1:5" />Hnakacy Jerusalem mary hak Juda pre mih nam htang hai imi byrbyr si cy kai va Johan hkam mihka, hmatva hai kamngo si hym hrithmut mihly Jordan O py va baptisma mina.<verse eid="MRK 1:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 1:6" />Johan cy kahlong kula-uk poi hly py mih lungki-hur ny, hkia tum cy kakawm mawipik hkabai mina. Hmat cy ca mʼplong hak kawitui mina. <verse eid="MRK 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 1:7" />Hmathmat ho jok imi si hkam mih cy, “Ang luk kye kyk mih imi cy ang kung kahtxp ra hym. Ang cy mi hai hpanai rui hym kamuk hklam jok hym mih mateng po nokatai lyng. <verse eid="MRK 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 1:8" />Ang cy ynni hym jok tui hly baptisma mina. Pei kapo mi hmat cy ynni hym jok Limla Syr hly baptisma hym hmang,” peipa jok mina.<verse eid="MRK 1:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Isu Py Baptisma mihak Parawi Mih</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 3:13-4:11">Mahtai 3.13—4.11</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 3:2">Luka 3.2</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22">22</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 4:1-13">4.1–13</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 1:9" />Hnakacy nokakra mihmat Isu cy Kalile pre Nazaret mary hai kahtxp ra ny, Jordan O Johan hkam py baptisma mina. <verse eid="MRK 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 1:10" />Isu cy tui ko hai kahpong mihly lamuk ka-ang ny, Limla cy yng bahu hto sxn kahtxp ra hmathmat luk mih ki mina. <verse eid="MRK 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 1:11" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1.11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 3:17">Mah 3.17</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 12:18">12.18</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:7">Mrk 9.7</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 3:22">Luk 3.22</ref></char></note>Pei mihka lamuk htang hai ra-yi cy, “Yn cy ang hkrei mih, ang hai Tahi na,” peipa mina.<verse eid="MRK 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 1:12" />Hnakacy Limla cy hmat hym ong kai krongci long ryp mina.<verse eid="MRK 1:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 1:13" />Hnakacy hmat hym krongci long liukawt ni txptxp Satan hmat parawi cam mina. Pei mihka ve krongci long kalei tawn si hly tym ny, hmat hym cy angel si hmat kry ny hking hkamcak mina.<verse eid="MRK 1:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Isu Hpau Lam Sara Liujua hym Mih</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 4:12-22">Mahtai 4.12–22</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 4:14">Luka 4.14</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 4:15">15</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:1-11">5.1–11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 1:14" />Johan vyng htong mikum, Isu cy kai Kalile pre htang ny ho Tamuk hai Satang Hnai si mina. <verse eid="MRK 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 1:15" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1.15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 3:2">Mah 3.2</ref></char></note> Hmat cy, “Ning cy katym ky! Tamuk hai Pyng mih cy hket ky! Ynni hai kamngo hrithmut va ny yb va hai!” pei mih Tamuk hai Pyng mira Satang Hnai hym txr mina.<verse eid="MRK 1:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 1:16" />Hnakacy Isu cy kaving hmang Kalile Ang tuitom mihka, Simon hak kahnau Andria hym ki mina. Mija cy lam sara si na miluk ny, vi tum jang ve ja lokpye mina. <verse eid="MRK 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 1:17" />Isu hmat mija mih hkam, “Kajun ja ang kung, ynci hym cy plau jok hnap imi hym mih sara hym,” peipa jok mina. <verse eid="MRK 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 1:18" />Mija cy lokpye si hym hjy ty ja klak ny kajun kai ja hmat kung ryp mina.<verse eid="MRK 1:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 1:19" />Hmat cy ye hai hmang kai hrawt mihka, Zebede hai tahi Jakob hak kahnau Johan hym ki mina. Mija cy long ko pahtyp ve ja lokpye mina. <verse eid="MRK 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 1:20" />Pei mihka Isu ki kacy hpau prawt ny, mija cy kapa Zebede hym anghnga si hak hjy ty long ko jo ny, kajun kai ja Isu kung mina.<verse eid="MRK 1:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Limla-ui Kajung Mih Imi Jua</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 4:31-37">Luka 4.31–37</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 1:21" />Hnakacy Isu hak hmat hai tabei si cy kai va Kapernaum mary ny, Isu cy Kanawn ni katym mihak kanup kai kacukim ko ny, txr riu mina. <verse eid="MRK 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 1:22" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1.22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 7:28">Mah 7.28</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 7:29">29</ref></char></note> Hmat hai txr riu mih sai hym imi si cy hkri-par lx va mina. Txr kacy, hmat cy tuk Rata mih sara si hai hto nona; amik ana ve mih hto hly txr riu mina. <verse eid="MRK 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 1:23" />Pei mihka kacukim tum limla-ui kajung mih imi ve jua mina. <verse eid="MRK 1:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 1:24" />Mi imi hmat, “Nazaret mary mih Isu, yn cy i hym napei py mih hia hai va? Ra i hym hprak hai ma? Yn cy miva, pei mih ang tuk; yn cy Tamuk hai imi syr na!” pei ot txr mina.<verse eid="MRK 1:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 1:25" />Isu hmat y-mi limla-ui hym, “Bongpa py kly, mi imi ko hai cawn kai!” pei pring ngak mina.<verse eid="MRK 1:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 1:26" />Pei mihka limla-ui cy mi imi hym hkri-par kajyng jok ny, lap hrahra mihly cawn kai mina. <verse eid="MRK 1:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 1:27" />Imi byrbyr si cy hkri-par lx va ny, “Mi cy napei hai hkym na hym va? Mi hai txr riu mih cy har let be! Mi imi cy limla-ui si hym mateng po jok amik ana kacy keng va let!” pei mih hmatva tingtawi kaklai katxr va mina.<verse eid="MRK 1:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 1:28" />Hnakacy Isu hai satang cy Kalile pre dyk ve mih nam-pia si tum po kamhtang kai prek ryp hnak mina.<verse eid="MRK 1:28" /></para>
  <para style="s">Rau Rahjak jua si hym Isu Py Hnai Mih</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 8:14-17">Mahtai 8.14–17</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 4:38-41">Luka 4.38–41</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 1:29" />Hnakacy Isu cy hmat hai tabei si hly kacukim hai cawn ny, Jakob mija Johan hly tym kaiva Simon mija Andria kim ko prawt ryp mina.<verse eid="MRK 1:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 1:30" />Pei mihka Simon hai kapi cy rau mih kalang ve mʼbai ko jo ny, imi si cy mi hai satang hym kamtei jok va Isu hkam prawt mina. <verse eid="MRK 1:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 1:31" />Hnakacy Isu cy kai mi kacai hkam mihka, mi kacai hai rut hym kamhkawr ny krxng mihly, mi kacai cy rau hnai ryp ny, misi hym hking hkamcak ryp mina. <verse eid="MRK 1:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 1:32" />Hnakacy rasa iu mih jak htang nʼklxm hka, imi si cy rau mih imi si hak limla-ui hmat hnap mih imi si hnget hym ong nang hmat hkam mina. <verse eid="MRK 1:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 1:33" />Mary dyk mih imi si cy mʼplot kenjam tum kahkxng ve ung hnak mina. <verse eid="MRK 1:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 1:34" />Pei mihka Isu cy rau conghkang cop mih imi rahjak jua si hym py jok hnai mikum, limla-ui rahjak jua si hym po pahtok kai mina. Limla-ui si cy hmar hmat hym miluk, misi hym kly nuk po nojok pyk.<verse eid="MRK 1:34" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kalile pre Isu Txrkly Mih</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 4:42-44">Luka 4.42–44</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 1:35" />Hna ngxr htang htyi nohtyi cx mihka, Isu cy rx ny, kim hai kaso kai mary kum htang sxp pei mih tum mihka pycuk mina. <verse eid="MRK 1:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 1:36" />Pei mihka Simon hak hmat hai rawi si cy hau hmathmat hym mina. <verse eid="MRK 1:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 1:37" />Kakrum hmat hym kacy, “Imi byrbyr si cy hau yn hym be!” pei kamtei mina.<verse eid="MRK 1:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 1:38" />Pei kapo Isu hmat, “I cy kenjam mih nam-pia si tum ho tara hym mih kai i mo, y-mi hai kavui ang cy ra hai,” peipa jok mina.<verse eid="MRK 1:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 1:39" />Hmat cy Kalile pre long ve mih kacukim si tum ho tara mihly nohnai mih limla-ui si hym pahtok mina.<verse eid="MRK 1:39" /></para>
  <para style="s">Isu Syr jok Imi jua hai Rangak Mih</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 8:1-4">Mahtai 8.1–4</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:12-16">Luka 5.12–16</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 1:40" />Rangak ve mih imi jua cy ra Isu hkam ny sakron kung mihly, “Yn hmat aly hia kacy ang hym hkym syr jok htai htung,”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1.40 </char><char style="fk" closed="false">syr jok htai htung: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mi rangak ve mih imi hym rata hly po nosyr pei mina.</char></note> pei kahui leng mina.<verse eid="MRK 1:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 1:41" />Isu cy mi imi hym van<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1.41 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">van; </char><char style="ft" closed="false">kawt mih kei ty rut hly mih ca-uk si luk cy </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">hrakkaluk, </char><char style="ft" closed="false">pei mina.</char></note> miluk, hmat hai rut hly mih imi hym hnap ny, “Ang aly hia, syr nahky!” peipa jok mina. <verse eid="MRK 1:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 1:42" />Peipa jok mihak mi hai rangak cy kahma ny, syr ryp mina. <verse eid="MRK 1:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 1:43" />Mi imi hkam Isu hmat jok ty kly hkik mih cy, <verse eid="MRK 1:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 1:44" />“Mi satang cy mimi hkam po bongpa txr a. Pahtyp tun hkam katxng jok ny, imi si hai nga tur jua mih tym plau sasi hym mih, yn hai kasyr mira hai kavui; Mosi hmat pxn ty mih ateng tahlam jok kalum mih hrung a,” pei jx ty hkik mihly hrua mina.<verse eid="MRK 1:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="MRK 1:45" />Pei kapo mi imi cy cawn kai hmat hkam hai kacy, hmat hkam katym mih satang hym kamtei txr jok linglyng miluk, kly tak htang kamhtang kai xr hnak mina. Pei miluk Isu cy nokanup mary ko mihmat, imi si hak kahly mih tum ve mary kum htang mina. Pei kapo betbet htang hai imi si cy katym ra hmathmat hkam mina.<verse eid="MRK 1:45" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="MRK 2" />
  <para style="s">Plau Mih Imi jua hym Isu Py Hnai Mih</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 9:1-8">Mahtai 9.1–8</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:17-26">Luka 5.17–26</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 2:1" />Nona nʼhkyt ni mihka Isu cy katym Kapernaum mary bei ny, hmat katym ve kim mih satang cy kahtyi ve hpuk hnak mina. <verse eid="MRK 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 2:2" />Pei mihka imi si cy hmat hkam kapluk ra va rahjak jua hnak miluk, mʼplot ken mateng po ve hym mih tym nokapia hnak. Isu cy misi hkam txr jok kly mina.<verse eid="MRK 2:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 2:3" />Pei mihka plau mih imi jua hym imi Liujua si hmat, kakryng nang Isu hkam mina. <verse eid="MRK 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 2:4" />Pei kapo imi mahu si kahkxng ve rahjak jua hnak miluk, hmat ken nohai kai va mina. Hnakacy misi cy hmat ve mih nxi beu kimluk ny, imi rau hym kakryng tym hly dyk sxn kla va plut htang mina. <verse eid="MRK 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 2:5" />Isu cy misi hai ybra hym ki kacy, plau mih imi hym, “Ang tahi jyi, yn hai kamngo si hym pahlawi ky hmang,” peipa jok mina.<verse eid="MRK 2:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 2:6" />Pei kapo y-mi tum cym ve mih tuk Rata mih sara kawt mih si hmat, <verse eid="MRK 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 2:7" />“Mi imi cy napei mih pei txr let va? Tamuk hym txr-cyk hai hna! Tamuk hmat jua kum kacy miva hkym hai pahlawi kamngo misai va?” pei kako va mina.<verse eid="MRK 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 2:8" />Imi si hai ra-ui pei kako va mih Isu hai ra-ui limla cy tuk jau prawt ny, “Ynni hai ra-ui ko napei kako hai va? <verse eid="MRK 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 2:9" />Plau mih imi hkam napei txr jok mih cy hjon kyk hym va? ‘Yn hai kamngo hym pahlawi ky,’ nona kacy, ‘Rx hai, yn hai mʼbai hym sxn ny hmang hai’ peipa jok mih cy hjon kyk ma? <verse eid="MRK 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 2:10" />Imi hai Tahi cy bonpre hai kamngo si hym hai pahlawi jok mih ana ve pei mih tuk jok ynni hym mih hia,” Pei txr mihly plau mih imi hym, <verse eid="MRK 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 2:11" />“Rx hai, yn hmat hai mʼbai hym sxn ny, hlawi kai yn hmat kim hai,” peipa jok mina.<verse eid="MRK 2:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 2:12" />Hnakacy mi imi cy rx ny imi mahu si nga sxn mʼbai mihly hmang kai prawt ryp mina. Imi byrbyr si cy lx va korkor ny, “Yng miplo hym i kut po noki vai hin!” pei txr mihly Tamuk hym pahlo va mina.<verse eid="MRK 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Isu Hpau Levi hym Mih</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 9:9-13">Mahtai 9.9–13</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:27-32">Luka 5.27–32</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 2:13" />Isu cy katym Kalile Ang tuitom bei ny, imi mahu si cy katym ra hmat hkam miluk, misi hym txr riu jok Tamuk hai klysai mina.<verse eid="MRK 2:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 2:14" />Hmat cy hmang mih tarawi, kawk kahmu mih tai tum Alahpe hai tahi Levi hym cym ve mih ki kacy, “Kajun ang kung,” peipa jok kacy, Levi cy rx ny kajun hmat kung ryp mina.<verse eid="MRK 2:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 2:15" />Hnakacy Isu cy Levi hai kim ko<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2.15 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Levi hai kim ko; </char><char style="ft" closed="false">nona kacy </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">hmathmat hai </char><char style="ft" closed="false">(Isu hai) </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">kim ko.</char></note> ca ve cak mihka, kawk kahmu mih imi si hak imi kamngo si po kajun hmat kung hrjak jua miluk ny, hmat hak tabei si hly kasua cym ca va cak tym mina. <verse eid="MRK 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 2:16" />Isu cy mi imi si hly pei ca ve va tym mihym, Hparisai si long hai tuk Rata mih sara si ki kacy, “Napei mih Isu cy kawk kahmu mih imi kamngo si hly napei hkam ca tym let va?” pei hlx jok hmat hai tabei si hym mina.<verse eid="MRK 2:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 2:17" />Misi pei hlx mih kly hym Isu tuk kacy, “Pik linghtu mih imi cy pram sara hym aly nohia lyng, pei kapo pik noling mih imi neni hia aly mina. Ang cy imi hnai si hym ra hpau mih nona lyng, hpau imi kamngo si hym mih ang ra hai htung,” peipa jok mina.<verse eid="MRK 2:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kawng Cak Mih Kahmu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 9:14-17">Mahtai 9.14–17</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:33-39">Luka 5.33–39</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 2:18" />Ni mihka Baptisma Johan kung kajun mih si hak Hparisai si cy kawng va cak mina. Kawt mih imi si cy ra Isu hkam ny, “Baptisma Johan hai tabei si hak Hparisai si hai tabei si cy kawng cak mina. Pei kapo Malai yn kung kajun mih si cy napei mih nokawng cak let va?” pei hlx va mina.<verse eid="MRK 2:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 2:19" />Isu hmat misi hkam, “Kapaw mih jua hai rawi si cy ve hmat hly tym mihtxm hkym kawng va cak hym ma? Misi cy kapaw mih jua hly ve tym miryk cy nokawng cak va lyng. <verse eid="MRK 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 2:20" />Pei kapo kapum hym mih kato hym misi hkam hai hpau kai vit mih ning ni katym hym ny, pei mihka misi cy kawng cak va hym mina.<verse eid="MRK 2:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 2:21" />“Mi po asa prim hym asa har hly nobu vai lyng, bu let kacy asa har cy katxng jok prxt hym ny, asa prim cy plut kye rat hym, <verse eid="MRK 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 2:22" />Yng mihto tyng mi po mawipik hklur prim luk krip jutui har hym nohkawng vai lyng; hkong let tok kapo krip tui har hmat mawipik hklur hym kahtek jok prek hym ny, krip tui po jat kai pxn hym mina. Krip tui har hym cy mawipik hklur har luk neni hkong mikla,” peipa jok mina.<verse eid="MRK 2:22" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kanawn Ni hai Kahmu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 12:1-8">Mahtai 12.1–8</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 6:1-5">Luka 6.1–5</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 2:23" />Kanawn ni hka Isu cy hmat hai tabei si hly kaving va kjung mi bai long mih tarawi, tabei si cy mikawi ui hym hprut txp va mina. <verse eid="MRK 2:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 2:24" />Pei mihka Hparisai si hmat Isu hkam, “Jau rih, Kanawn ni hai Rata hly nokamlau mih pxn py va let!” pei hlx va mina.<verse eid="MRK 2:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 2:25" />Isu hmat, “Davida cy hmat hak rawi si hrakbxt va mihka, napei py va bah pei mih ynni nohprai vai mih sai ma? <verse eid="MRK 2:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 2:26" />Pahtyp tun mang Abiata lahta hka Davida cy kanup Tamuk hai kim ko ny, rata luk pahtyp tun mang si ngai ca sang mih pet ryi ty mih kom hym ca ny, hmat hai rawi si hym po ret jok tyng ria mina.”<verse eid="MRK 2:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 2:27" />Hnakacy Isu hmat misi hkam, “Kanawn ni cy imi hai kavui py ty mina. Imi cy Kanawn ni hai kavui nona lyng. <verse eid="MRK 2:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 2:28" />Pei miluk Imi hai Tahi cy Kanawn ni hai Malai na,” peipa jok mina.<verse eid="MRK 2:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="MRK 3" />
  <para style="s">Rut lyi Plau Mih Imi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 12:9-14">Mahtai 12.9–14</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 6:6-11">Luka 6.6–11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 3:1" />Hnakacy Isu cy kanup kacukim bei ny, Y-mi tum rut lyi plau mih imi ve jua mina. <verse eid="MRK 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 3:2" />Kawt mih imi si cy Isu hym hia nga hau ny, Kanawn ni hka rut plau mih mi hym py jok hnai hym bah nopy jok bah pei mih hmat hym patym jau va paryp mina. <verse eid="MRK 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 3:3" />Isu hmat rut lyi plau mih imi hkam, “Ra jyng imi mahu si nga rih,” peipa jok mina. <verse eid="MRK 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 3:4" />Hnakacy Isu hmat imi si hkam, “I hai Rata luk cy Kanawn ni hka py jok hnai si sang ma? nona kacy kanga jok sang ma? Imi hym pahlawi jok sang ma? Pahtyk sang ma?” pei hlx jok mina. Pei kapo misi cy nasai po nohtim jok mina.<verse eid="MRK 3:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 3:5" />Isu cy hrakkaluk mihly misi hym jau kanumkrut ny, misi hai ra-ui kxr cop miluk, ra-ui nohnai mihly hmat, rut plau mih imi hym, “Hpeng yn hai rut rih,” peipa jok ny, mi imi cy rut hym hpeng mihak, rut cy hnai kari ateng ryp mina. <verse eid="MRK 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 3:6" />Pei mihka Hparisai si cy kacukim hai cawn kai va prawt ny, Isu hym napei pahtyk hym bah pei mih Heroda hai imi si hly timtum karam va prawt mina.<verse eid="MRK 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Imi Mahu si ve Ang Pang Mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 3:7" />Hnakacy Isu cy hmat hai tabei si hly tym kai va Kalile Ang htang ny, hmathmat kung imi mahu si po kajun rahjak jua hnak mina. Misi cy Kalile pre htang hai po, Juda pre htang hai po, <verse eid="MRK 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 3:8" />Jerusalem mary htang hai po, Idumai pre htang hai po, Jordan O nʼlot pang htang hai po, Tura hak Sidom mary hai kaso kly tak htang mih imi byrbyr si po Isu hai py nana mih satang si hym tuk miluk ra va hmat hkam mina. <verse eid="MRK 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 3:9" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3.9,10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MRK 4:1">Mrk 4.1</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:1-3">Luk 5.1–3</ref></char></note> Isu hmat, imi mahu si hly noka-et hym mih, hmat hai kavui kahri ty ty long hlyk yb hym mih, txr jok hmat hai tabei si hkam mina. <verse eid="MRK 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 3:10" />Txr kacy, hmat cy imi rau si rahjak jua hym py jok hnai miluk ny, rau mih imi si hnget cy hmat hym man kabet hym mih ka-et ra va mina. <verse eid="MRK 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 3:11" />Hnakacy limla-ui si cy, ki hmat hym mihka kabawk hmat nga ny, “Yn cy Tamuk hai Tahi na!” pei ot va mina.<verse eid="MRK 3:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 3:12" />Isu cy hmathmat hym miva na pei mih mimi hkam po notxr hym mih limla-ui hkam jok ty kly hrxk mina.<verse eid="MRK 3:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Isu Ryi Rahmang Prelai jua Mih</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 10:1-4">Mahtai 10.1–4</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 6:12-16">Luka 6.12–16</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 3:13" />Hnakacy Isu cy cyng pxr kai hrxng ny, hmat hai hia aly mih imi si hym hpau ny, misi po ra hmat hkam mina. <verse eid="MRK 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 3:14" />Hnakacy hmat cy ryi prelai jua misi hym ny, rahmang si pei rxk ty ming mina. Hnakacy misi hkam, “Ynni cy ve ang hly tym hym mihak, ho tara hym mih ang hrua ynni hym ny, <verse eid="MRK 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 3:15" />nohnai mih limla-ui si hym hai pahtok mih amik ana po jok ynni hym” peipa jok mina.<verse eid="MRK 3:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 3:16" />Hmat hai ryi mih prelai jua misi hai ming cy: (Isu hmat Petara, pei hpau mih) Simon, <verse eid="MRK 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 3:17" />(Karai lei, Bonerkia pei rxk ty ming har mih) Zebede hai tahi pre jua Jakob hak kahnau Johan, <verse eid="MRK 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 3:18" />Andria, Hpilipa, Batolame, Mahtai, Htawma, Alahpe hai tahi Jakob, Htadai, hkrei Amjy mih Simon hak, <verse eid="MRK 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 3:19" />Hnap jok Isu hym mih Juda Isakarot si na.<verse eid="MRK 3:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Isu hak Beelzebula</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 12:22-32">Mahtai 12.22–32</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 11:14-23">Luka 11.14–23</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 12:10">12.10</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 3:20" />Pei mihka Isu cy kanup kim ko ny, imi mahu rahjak jua si cy kahkxng ra va bei miluk, Isu hak hmat hai tabei si cy ca cak hym mipar po ning noman hnak mina. <verse eid="MRK 3:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 3:21" />Kawt mih misi hmat, “Mi cy htu kaivit ky!” pei txr va miluk, pei mih satang hym hmat hai kimko si tuk kacy, kry hmathmat hym mih ra va mina.<verse eid="MRK 3:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 3:22" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">3.22 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 9:34">Mah 9.34</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 10:25">10.25</ref></char>
    </note>Jerusalem mary hai katym ra mih tuk Rata mih makye si hmat, “Mi hkam cy Beelzebula kajung hai hna! Mi cy limla-ui mang hai tako hly nohnai mih limla-ui si hym pahtok hai htung,” pei txr va mina.<verse eid="MRK 3:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 3:23" />Hnakacy Isu hmat misi hym hpau ny, kanyk kly si hly txr jok mih cy, “Satan cy Satan hmathmat hym napei hai pahtok htai hym va? <verse eid="MRK 3:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 3:24" />Tengpre po ihmat tingtawi katu ryp kacy kanga cohkrang hym. <verse eid="MRK 3:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 3:25" />Yng-mihto tyng kimko po ihmat kimko tingtawi katu ryp kacy, y-mi kimko cy nohai hkawt lyng. <verse eid="MRK 3:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 3:26" />Yng mihto tyng, Satan hai pyng mira po hmatva tingtawi katu ny kahpat kai hpro kacy, nohai ve hym ny, kung cy kahnawi cohkrang mira katym hym mina.<verse eid="MRK 3:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 3:27" />“Mimi po hra kye mih imi hym ri hmat notomcai pai kacy kanup kim ko ny, hmat hai kimsut si hym nohai kxn po kai lyng. Mi hym tomcai pai ri vit mihka neni po htai hym mina.<verse eid="MRK 3:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 3:28" />“Ang txr ynni rui hkyp hym: imi si hai kamngo si byrbyr hak Tamuk hym txr cyk mih kamngo byrbyr si<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3.28 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Tamuk hym txr cyk mih kamngo byrbyr si; </char><char style="ft" closed="false">nona kacy </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">pawp mih si pei txr mina.</char></note> hnget hym cy pahlawi jok htai. <verse eid="MRK 3:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 3:29" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3.29 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 12:10">Luk 12.10</ref></char></note> Pei kapo Limla Syr hym txr cyk mih imi cy ynghak hka po kamngo kahlawi mira man hym mih nona. Mi cy dungjan aprek num mih mi na.” <verse eid="MRK 3:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 3:30" />Isu pei txr mih cy kawt mih imi si hmat cy, “Hmat hym limla-ui kajung mih imi,” pei kung va miluk na.<verse eid="MRK 3:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Isu hai Kanu hak Kahnau si</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 12:46-50">Mahtai 12.46–50</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:19-21">Luka 8.19–21</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 3:31" />Hnakacy Isu hai kanu hak kahnau si cy katym ra ny jyng ve kum htang mihka, hpau hmat hym mih hrua va imi hym mina. <verse eid="MRK 3:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 3:32" />Imi mahu si cy Isu hym kakua cym ve va num hnak mina. Misi cy hmat hkam, “Jau rih, yn nu, yn hnau si hak cei si cy hau yn hym ny ming ve va kum htang jo,” peipa jok mina.<verse eid="MRK 3:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 3:33" />Isu hmat misi hkam, “Ang hai kanu hak ang hai kahnau si cei si cy miva va?” pei hlx jok tyng mina. <verse eid="MRK 3:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 3:34" />Hmat cy kakua cym ve num mih imi si hym jau kanum krut ny, “Jau rih! Ang hai kanu hak ang hai kahnau si cei si cy cami na cah! <verse eid="MRK 3:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 3:35" />Mimi po Tamuk hai rahjak py mih imi si hnget cy, ang hai kanu hak kahnau si, cei si na ky!” peipa jok mina.<verse eid="MRK 3:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="MRK 4" />
  <para style="s">Hpat Liu mihly Kanyk Mih</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 13:1-9">Mahtai 13.1–9</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:4-8">Luka 8.4–8</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 4:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">4.1 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LUK 5:1-3">Luk 5.1–3</ref>
      </char>
    </note> Isu cy Kalile Ang tuitawm ken kahang txr riu bei mina. Imi mahu si cy kapluk katym ra hmathmat hkam miluk ny, hmat cy Ang tuitawm ve mih long hlyk luk pxr ny katang mina. Imi mahu si cy jyng ve va pang tum mina. <verse eid="MRK 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 4:2" />Hnakacy hmat cy imi si hym txr jok kanyk kly hly mina.<verse eid="MRK 4:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 4:3" />“Keng va rih! Hpat liu mih imi jua cy hpat liu hym mih kai mina. <verse eid="MRK 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 4:4" />Hpat liu mihka kawt mih liu si cy vyng mʼhma tum ny, va si hmat ra ny cawm ca kai vit. <verse eid="MRK 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 4:5" />Kawt mih liu si cy vyng bon pa mih huatia bon tum miluk, ru prawt tok kapo, <verse eid="MRK 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 4:6" />rasa rau heu kacy hap miluk ny, nohai htxp hing mihmat, raw kai vit mina. <verse eid="MRK 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 4:7" />Kawt mih liu si cy vyng nʼcu bing long ny, nʼcu bing si hmat plum miluk, ui kawi nohai kacyng mina. <verse eid="MRK 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 4:8" />Pei kapo kawt mih liu si cy vyng bon hnai tum miluk, ru kacy hring kacyng nʼtawn ny; kawt mih cy nʼkawm, bet si cy ruk kawt, bet si cy sum pei mih ui kawi si krung cyng ra ky,” peipa jok mina.<verse eid="MRK 4:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 4:9" />Hnakacy Isu hmat, “Mimi po keng hym mih taram ve kacy tuk nahky!” peipa jok mina.<verse eid="MRK 4:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kanyk Kly hai Patyp Mih</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 13:10-17">Mahtai 13.10–17</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:9-10">Luka 8.9–10</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 4:10" />Hnakacy Isu cy hmat mahlyk ve mihtxm hka, tabei prelai jua si hak misi hai rawi si cy kai ny, kanyk kly hai patyp misai hym hlx va mina. <verse eid="MRK 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 4:11" />Isu hmat misi hkam, “Tamuk hai Pyng mira kly bxb prai mih satang si hym tuk hym mih ynni man mina. Pei kapo kum htang ve mih imi si cy, notuk miluk kanyk mih kly si hly txr jok hai htung. <verse eid="MRK 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 4:12" />Napei hai pei kacy,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 4:12">“ ‘Misi cy jau tok kapo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MRK 4:12">noki va;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 4:12">misi cy keng tok kapo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MRK 4:12">notuk va pyr mina.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 4:12">Nona mihmat, misi cy ki mihak tuk kako let kacy, kut ra va Tamuk hkam tyng hym ny,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MRK 4:12">misi cy pahlawi kamngo mira man hym,’ ” pei txr jok mina.<verse eid="MRK 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Hpat Liu Mih Kanyk Kly hym Plim Txr Mih</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 13:18-23">Mahtai 13.18–23</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:11-15">Luka 8.11–15</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 4:13" />Hnakacy Isu hmat misi hkam, “Ynni cy cami kanyk kly hym notuk pyr misai ma? Pei hai kacy bet kanyk mih kly si hym cy ynni napei tuk pyr lek hym va? <verse eid="MRK 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 4:14" />Hpat liu mih mi cy hpat Tamuk hai klysai mina. <verse eid="MRK 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 4:15" />Kawt mih imi si cy vyng mʼhma tum mih liu hly kayng. Misi cy klysai hym tuk kapo Satan cy ra prawt ny, hpat ty mih klysai hym bui kai vit mih sai hym txr mina. <verse eid="MRK 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 4:16" />Yng mihto tyng, kawt mih imi si cy vyng huatia bon tum mih liu si hly kayng mina. Misi cy klysai hym tuk mihak hrakpau mihly lahkai prawt mina. <verse eid="MRK 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 4:17" />Pei kapo y-mi klysai cy ra-ui ko nohtxp hing si miluk nokakan. Y-mi klysai luk ra rai mira si bah, nona kacy tongnang mira bah kakrum kacy, misi cy katim kai va prawt ryp mina. <verse eid="MRK 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 4:18" />Kawt mih imi si cy vyng nʼcu bing long mih liu si hly kayng mina. Misi cy klysai hym keng tok kapo, <verse eid="MRK 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 4:19" />bonpre hringvek hai kavui ra-ui kaling kamawn mira si, malai mira hai kapawp mira si hak ra-ui hai hia hpi nokai rui mih si hmat klysai hym plum kai vit miluk ui noui misai hym txr hai mina. <verse eid="MRK 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 4:20" />Pei kapo kawt mih imi si cy vyng bon hnai tum mih liu hly kayng mina. Misi cy klysai hym tuk mihak kamhkawr prawt ny, kawt mih cy nʼkawm, kawt mih cy rukkawt, kawt mih cy ui ra sum mih sai hym txr hai mih,” peipa jok mina.<verse eid="MRK 4:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Muk ty Tong Mih Hmaipu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 8:16-18">Luka 8.16–18</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 4:21" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">4.21 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 5:15">Mah 5.15</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 11:33">Luk 11.33</ref></char>
    </note> Hnakacy Isu hmat misi hkam, mimi po, “Hmai pu hym cy ty sang mih tum noty mihmat, tong kly bah, kadang kly tum bah, ty vai misai ma? Hmai pu hkung nxi ty hym mih nona mih sai ma? <verse eid="MRK 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 4:22" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4.22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 10:26">Mah 10.26</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 12:2">Luk 12.2</ref></char></note> Napei hai pei kacy, kanin ve pinlo mih si hnget po katxng hym ny, hrxm ty mih si hnget po kahpong ra hym, peipa jok mina. <verse eid="MRK 4:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 4:23" />Taram ve mih mi cy, tuk keng va nahky!” peipa jok mina.<verse eid="MRK 4:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 4:24" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">4.24 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 7:2">Mah 7.2</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 6:38">Luk 6.38</ref></char>
    </note> Hnakacy Isu hmat misi hkam, “Ynni hai tuk nana si mih cy keng va hnai pxng! Ynni cy misi hym nye ty hkyp mihak ynni jok mina. Yng mihto ynni hym misi hmat jok tyng hym. Miluk nonai kanawi jok ynni bei hym. <verse eid="MRK 4:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 4:25" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4.25 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 13:12">Mah 13.12</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 25:29">25.29</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 19:26">Luk 19.26</ref></char></note> Napei hai pei kacy, ve mih mi hym cy klyng jok rat bei hym, nove mih mi hkam hai cy hmat hai ve mih si hnget hym po, paw kai pxn rat hym,” peipa jok mina.<verse eid="MRK 4:25" /></para>
  <para style="s">Liu Ru mihly Kanyk Mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 4:26" />Hnakacy Isu hmat txr bei mih cy, “Tamuk hai Pyng mira cy, imi jua hmat, hmathmat hai vit tum hpat liu bon nxi mih hly kayng mina. <verse eid="MRK 4:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 4:27" />Hmat cy hruk, rani, mxi ve, rx ve mihka liu cy ru ny hring kye nang hryihryi mina. Pei kapo liu si cy napei ru bah, napei kye ra bah pei mih cy hmat notuk. <verse eid="MRK 4:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 4:28" />Bon hmat cy ui jok ny, cxk-ri cy hring, mikum cy long, mikum cy ui kawi, mikum cy ui kawi ko hai kaplau nang nuk hrek mina. <verse eid="MRK 4:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 4:29" />Mi min ky pei kacy veng hym mih ning katym miluk, hmat cy po nʼkra ny kahang veng prawt ryp ky,” peipa jok mina.<verse eid="MRK 4:29" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kanyk Mʼmua Liu hly Mih</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 13:31-32">Mahtai 13.31–32–34</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 13:18-19">Luka 13.18–19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 4:30" />Hnakacy Isu hmat, “Tamuk hai Pyng mira hym cy kanyk na hly hym va? Nona kacy kanyk na hly mihka txr jok hnaipxng hym va? <verse eid="MRK 4:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 4:31" />Y-mi cy kayng mʼmua liu hly mina. Mʼmua liu cy bon pre ve mih liu byrbyr si long le kyk. <verse eid="MRK 4:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 4:32" />Pei kapo ru mikum hring kacyng mihka kacy, bet mih hring byrbyr si luk po kye kyk let mina. Nxi htang mih va si man pum pyk mipar mei pang si kye ra mina,” peipa jok ky.<verse eid="MRK 4:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 4:33" />Isu cy imi si tuk keng mipar txr jok kanyk kly rahjak mina. <verse eid="MRK 4:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 4:34" />Hmat cy kanyk kly hly nona kacy notxr vai lyng. Pei kapo hmat hai tabei si hym cy, hmat mahlyk ve mihka plim txr jok hnaipxng hmat mina.<verse eid="MRK 4:34" /></para>
  <para style="s">Isu hmat Rim Timpu hym Mih</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 8:23-27">Mahtai 8.23–27</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:22-25">Luka 8.22–25</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 4:35" />Y-mi ni jak htang mih ning hka Isu cy, hamt hai tabei si hkam, “Kapyng i ang pang htang mo,” peipa jok mina. <verse eid="MRK 4:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 4:36" />Tabei si cy imi mahu si long hai cawn ny, Isu katym ve yb mih long ko pxr ny katang va tym mina. Bet mih long si po hmat hly tym kajun va mina. <verse eid="MRK 4:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 4:37" />Pei mihka hkri-par prxng mih timpu fangkau katym ra muk miluk, tui hleng hmat hta miluk ny long ko cy tui katek bxb van hnak mina. <verse eid="MRK 4:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 4:38" />Pei mihka Isu cy longram htang klxng raklxng ny mxi kai ngym mina. Tabei si cy krxng hmathmat hym ny, “Sara jyi, i cy htyk hym ky yn noyisy hnak ky ma?” peipa va mina.<verse eid="MRK 4:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 4:39" />Pei mihka Isu cy rx ny, tim fang hak tui hleng hym, “Kanawn ny, rim hai!” peipa jok kacy tim fang hak tui hleng po rim kai ny pynlau pei ryp mina. <verse eid="MRK 4:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 4:40" />Isu hmat tabei si hkam, “Ynni cy napei tan kram hnak hai va? Ynni hkam ybra nove hnak misai ma?” peipa jok mina.<verse eid="MRK 4:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 4:41" />Misi cy hkri-par kram hyng hnak ny, “Mi imi cy miva hkym na hym va? Tim hak tui hleng si mateng po hmat hai kly hym keng let be!” pei txr va linglyng mina.<verse eid="MRK 4:41" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="MRK 5" />
  <para style="s">Limla-ui Kajung Mih Imi hym Isu hmat Py Hnai Mih</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 8:28-34">Mahtai 8.28–34</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:26-39">Luka 8.26–39</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 5:1" />Isu hak hmat hai tabei si cy katym va Kalile Ang pang htang ve mih Kerasin ne tum mina. <verse eid="MRK 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 5:2" />Isu cy long ko hai kahkx mihka limla-ui kajung mih imi jua cy cawn nang klan htang hai ny, kaklyng ming ve hmat hym mina. <verse eid="MRK 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 5:3" />Mi imi cy kajong ve klan si tum ny, mimi po mi imi hym cai ty singkry rui hly hym mih po nohai man lek. <verse eid="MRK 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 5:4" />Napei hai pei kacy mi hym cy kua hly po xk ny, singkry rui hly po cai vai mina. Pei kapo singkry rui hym kxt kaihpro ny, kua hym po kyi kai pukpak mipar hra ve miluk mimi po nohai kry hnak mina. <verse eid="MRK 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 5:5" />Hmat cy klan si tum, hrxng pang si tum hruk rani ot lap mihly, hua jxr hak hmathmat hym kahen ryry mina.<verse eid="MRK 5:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 5:6" />Mi imi cy hla hai kaso Isu hym ki kacy pjung ra ny hmat nga sakron kung mihly kahui ny, <verse eid="MRK 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 5:7" />“Isu, Hrau kyk mih Tamuk hai Tahi jyi! Yn cy ang hly kabet na misai va? Bongpa panang ang hym, Tamuk hai ming hly yn hkam ang kahui hai ky!” pei ot mina. <verse eid="MRK 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 5:8" />Napei hai pei kacy, Isu hmat mi imi hkam, “Limla-ui yn cy, mi imi hkam hai cawn kai vit!” pei jokjok amik miluk na.<verse eid="MRK 5:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 5:9" />Hnakacy Isu hmat, “Yn hai ming cy miva va?” pei hlx mina.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 5:9">Mi mi hmat cy, “Ang hai ming cy, ‘Lekong,’ na, i cy ve hrjak jua miluk na!” pei htim jok mina. <verse eid="MRK 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 5:10" />Hnakacy y-mi ne long hai hmatva hym nopahtok kai bet htang hym mih kahui va Isu hkam mina.<verse eid="MRK 5:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 5:11" />Y-mi hrxng ken cy pak hu si cy ca ve lakcak mina. <verse eid="MRK 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 5:12" />Hnakacy limla-ui si hmat Isu hkam, “I hym kanup pak si hkam hym mih jok nang cx,” pei leng va mina. <verse eid="MRK 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 5:13" />Isu hmat kanup hym mih jok mihak, limla-ui si cy cawn y-mi hkam hai kacy kanup kai pak si hkam ny, ve pre sang bah mih pak hu si cy sxn pjung kai mahkyk hpyr htang ny, kajyr kai vi tum ny, htyk kai pxn mina.<verse eid="MRK 5:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 5:14" />Hnakacy pak kry mih imi si cy pjung va ny, mi satang hym cy kamte txr jok mary, nam si htang ve mih imi si hkam mina. Pei mihka imi si cy napei hprek hai bah pei ny, ra va jau mina. <verse eid="MRK 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 5:15" />Katym va Isu hkam mihka kacy, limla-ui lekong kajung mih imi cy kahlong hkuk-xk pxng ny, hmat cy ra-ui kari ateng hly cym ve mih ki va kacy kram va mina. <verse eid="MRK 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 5:16" />Ki mih imi si hmat po limla-ui kajung mih imi napei hnai ra haibah pei mih sai si hak, pak si hai satang hym kamtei jok imi si hkam mina.<verse eid="MRK 5:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 5:17" />Hnakacy misi hmat hmatva ne hai cawn kai vit hym mih Isu hkam kahui leng va mina.<verse eid="MRK 5:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 5:18" />Isu cy katang long ko hput mihka, limla-ui kajung plun mih imi hmat Isu hkam, “Yn kung jok ang hym kajun cx!” pei leng mina.<verse eid="MRK 5:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 5:19" />Pei kapo Isu cy, kajun hym mih ahkawn nojok mihmat, “Hlawi kai yn hmat nam ny, Malai hmat napei py jok yn hym bah, yng na tan van yn hym bah, pei mih txr jok imi si hkam a,” peipa jok mina.<verse eid="MRK 5:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 5:20" />Hnakacy mi imi cy kai Dikapoli ne ve mih ha mary htang ny, hmat hkam Isu hmat py jok hnai mih sai satang hym txr jok miluk, imi byrbyr si cy lx va mina.<verse eid="MRK 5:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jaira hai Tama hak Kabet Isu hai Avawi Mih Kacai</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 9:18-26">Mahtai 9.18–26</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:40-56">Luka 8.40–56</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 5:21" />Isu cy long hly tapyng ang pang htang bei ny, ve ang tuitom mihka, nona ok-ai mih imi mahu si cy kapluk ra va hmat hkam mina. <verse eid="MRK 5:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 5:22" />Pei mihka kacukim kry mih lu Jaira pei mih imi jua katym ra kacy, ki Isu hym mihak kabawk hkawktut tum ny, <verse eid="MRK 5:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 5:23" />“Ang hai tama lawi mi cy rau nohai hnak miluk, rau hnai tyng hym mih van prai mihly yn hmat ra rih ny, mi hkam mum jok rut cx rih,” pei kahui leng mina.<verse eid="MRK 5:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 5:24" />Isu cy kai Jaira hly tym mina. Pei mihka nona ok-ai mih imi mahu si po kajun va hmat kung ny, hmathmat hym kakling ve rahkong hnak mina.<verse eid="MRK 5:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 5:25" />Pei mihka kacai jua cy prelai la txptxp vi pahor miluk, <verse eid="MRK 5:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 5:26" />pram sara rahjak jua si hkam katang ny, hmat hkam ve mih cong nʼka si po kahkawi kai pxn hnak mina. Pei kapo hnai cx mih nove mihmat, ty nang rat hnak mina. <verse eid="MRK 5:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 5:27" />Mi kacai cy Isu hai satang hym tuk miluk ny, hmat hai lungki-hur hym kabet kacy hnai hym pei mihly, imi mahu si tare kahreng ka-ek kai hmat hkam ny, <verse eid="MRK 5:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 5:28" />“Ang cy kabet hamt hai lungki hur hly kacy rau hnai hym,” pei mihly kai kabet mina.<verse eid="MRK 5:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 5:29" />Hnakacy mi kacai cy hmat hai lungki hur hym kabet mihly hmat hai vi si cy ngyt ryp ny, hmat hnai kai vit misai cy hmat hai lungnga luk katuk mina. <verse eid="MRK 5:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 5:30" />Pei mihka Isu cy hmat hkam hai tako cawn kai mih katuk prawt ny, kaplang jau imi mahu si htang mihka, “Ang hai lungki hur hym miva kabet hai va?” pei hlx mina.<verse eid="MRK 5:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 5:31" />Tabei si hmat cy, “Imi mahu si hmat yn hym ka-et ve rahkong hnak mih yn ki tok mihmat; Ang hym miva kabet pei mih cy napei hai mih?” peipa va mina.<verse eid="MRK 5:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 5:32" />Pei kapo Isu cy hmat hym miva kabet bah, pei mih hia tuk ny kaplang jua num hnak mina. <verse eid="MRK 5:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 5:33" />Mi kacai cy hmathmat lungnga luk hnai misai katuk miluk, kram hyng mihly, hmat nga sakron kung ny, hmat hym txr jok rui hkyp mina. <verse eid="MRK 5:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 5:34" />Isu hmat mi kacai hym, “Ang tama, yn hai ybra hmat yn hym kahlawi jok ky. Vehnem mihly hmang ny, yn hai rau si hnai nahky,” peipa jok mina.<verse eid="MRK 5:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 5:35" />Isu cy pei txr ve kly hput mihka, kacukim kry mih lu Jaira nam hai kawt mih imi si cy katym ra ny, “Yn hai tama cy htyk kai vit ky, sara hym cy ynni bongpa hkruhkra ky?” peipa jok mina.<verse eid="MRK 5:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 5:36" />Pei kapo Isu cy mi imi hai txr mih kly hym noyisy mihmat,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5.36 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">noyisy mihmat; </char><char style="ft" closed="false">nona kacy </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">notuk.</char></note> kacukim kry mih lu hym “Bongpa kamawn, yb pai yb a,” peipa jok mina. <verse eid="MRK 5:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 5:37" />Hnakacy Petara, Jakob hak jakob hai kahnau Johan kum kacy mimi hym po hmathmat hly tym nojok kajun. <verse eid="MRK 5:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 5:38" />Isu cy katym kacukim kry mih lu Jaira nam kacy, imi si cy ei ve sau-ngur mih ki mina. <verse eid="MRK 5:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 5:39" />Hmat cy kanup kim ko ny misi hkam, “Ynni cy napei hai ei lap ve sau-ngur hnak va? Mi raca cy nohtyk lyng, mxi ve hai htung,” peipa jok mina.<verse eid="MRK 5:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 5:40" />Pei mihka imi si cy ren jok hmathmat hym let mina. Hnakacy hmat cy imi si hym cawn jok kum htang mihka, raca hai kanu kapa hak tabei hrumjua si hym hpau ny kanup kai raca ve mih ra-un ko mina. <verse eid="MRK 5:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 5:41" />Pei mihka hmat cy tyng raca hai rut hym ny, “Talihta, koum,” peipa jok mina. Y-mi cy, “Katung jyi, ang txr yn ky, rx hai! Pei mih sai na,” peipa mina.<verse eid="MRK 5:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 5:42" />Hnakacy mi kacai raca cy rx prawt ny hmang kai ryp mina. Mi kacai raca cy ve prelai la mina. Pei mihka imi si cy hkri-par lx va kawrkawr hnak. <verse eid="MRK 5:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 5:43" />Hnakacy Isu hmat, mi satang hym cy mimi hkam po notxr hym mih jok ty kly hrxk mikum, “Mi raca ca hym mih hking jok nana hlykhlyk deh,” peipa jok mina.<verse eid="MRK 5:43" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="MRK 6" />
  <para style="s">Isu hym Nazaret Mary hmat Nohia Mih</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 13:53-58">Mahtai 13.53–58</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 4:16-30">Luka 4.16–30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 6:1" />Isu cy y-mi hai cawn kai mihka hmat hai tabei si po kajun ria ny, katym va hmathmat hai ve mih mary prim tum mina. <verse eid="MRK 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 6:2" />Hmat cy Kanawn ni hka kacukim tum txr riu mih sai si keng mihka imi si cy hkri-par lx va mina “Mi imi hai py nana mih si man yngham htang hai pi mʼmo? Mi hai cing mira cy man yngham hai va? Mi ringrang si napei py htai hai va? <verse eid="MRK 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 6:3" />Mi imi cy Mari hai tahi, Jakob, Josehpa, Juda hak Simon si hai katai kahnau latsama nona misai ma? Mi hai cei si po ve i hly tym htung nona ma?” pei txr va ny, hmat hym nohia jau va mina.<verse eid="MRK 6:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 6:4" />Isu hmat misi hkam, “Ahmo cy hmathmat hai ve mih nam mary prim tum, jxr-at si long, hmat hai kim ko kum kacy yngham mitum po tamu ve,” peipa jok mina.<verse eid="MRK 6:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 6:5" />Hnakacy hmat cy, rau mih imi kawt mih si hkam klyng jok rut ny rau hym py jok hnai mikum kacy, nana ringrang si po nokatxng jok ky. <verse eid="MRK 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 6:6" />Mi imi si noyb miluk hmathmat cy lx hnak mina. Mikum Isu cy kai kenjam mih nam si tum ny txr riu jok mina.<verse eid="MRK 6:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Isu Hrua Tabei Prelai jua si hym Mih</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 10:5-15">Mahtai 10.5–15</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:1-6">Luka 9.1–6</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 6:7" />Hnakacy Isu cy prelai jua mih tabei si hym hpau mihka, kamkawm jok pre prejua ny hrua nam si htang mina. Misi hym hai pahtok limla-ui si hym mih tako ana jok jok mina. <verse eid="MRK 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 6:8" />Hmathmat cy misi hkam, “Ynni cy mʼhma hai kavui nʼhkron-mua hlyk kum kacy, na sai po bongpa sxn va. Kom po, sxk po, hkabai luk pasa nʼka si po bongpa sxn va. <verse eid="MRK 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 6:9" />Pei kapo hpanai cy kahlong va. Bongpa sxn va lungki klai,” peipa jok mina. <verse eid="MRK 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 6:10" />Hnakacy misi hkam, “Yngham mih tum po na nahky ynni katym mihka, cum lyn ynni hym mih kim tum pxr ny katym va, y-mi mary hai nocawn miryk cy bongpa kahrxt va bet htang. <verse eid="MRK 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 6:11" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6.11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 13:51">Rah 13.51</ref> </char></note> Yngham mih mary tum po na nahky imi si hmat ynni hym nocum lyn, nokeng ynni hai kly hym kacy, y-mi tum hai cawn kai mihka, misi hym plau jok sasi hym mih, ynni hai hkokhpa luk hai tabur hym tahkok va a!” peipa jok mina.<verse eid="MRK 6:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 6:12" />Hnakacy tabei si cy cawn kai va ny, imi si man hrithmut hym mih satang ho jok mina. <verse eid="MRK 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 6:13" />Hnakacy pahtok va limla-ui si rahjak jua hym ny, rau mih imi rahjak jua misi hym po pahtxm jok olivi hrau hly ny rau hnai jok mina.<verse eid="MRK 6:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Baptisma Johan Htyk Mih</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 14:1-12">Mahtai 14.1–12</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:7-9">Luka 9.7–9</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 6:14" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">6.14,15 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 16:14">Mah 16.14</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 8:28">Mrk 8.28</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:19">Luk 9.19</ref></char>
    </note>Isu hai ming cy kly tak kamhtang xr hnak miluk, Sangmrang Heroda<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6.14 </char><char style="fk" closed="false">Sangmrang Heroda: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Pyng Kalile pre mih Heroda Antipa.</char></note> cy tuk mi satang mina. Kawt mih imi si hmat, “Baptisma Johan cy htyk mih long hai rx tyng hai ky. Pei miluk ny, mi cy txng jok ringrang si htai hai mih,” pei txr va mina.<verse eid="MRK 6:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 6:15" />Kawt mih imi si hmat cy, “Mi imi cy Elija na,” pei txr va.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 6:15">Kawt mih imi si hmat cy, “Hmat cy kanila mih ahmo hto, Ahmo jua na,” pei txr va mina.<verse eid="MRK 6:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 6:16" />Isu hai satang hym Heroda tuk mihka kacy, “Anghmat klyk kai lu vit mih Johan rx tyng hai ky!” pei txr mina. <verse eid="MRK 6:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 6:17" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6.17,18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 3:19">Luk 3.19</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 3:20">20</ref></char></note> Heroda cy kxn pai kahnau Hpilipi hai ju Herodi hym mih kahmu ra, hmat cy hrua imi hym mihka Johan hym hnap cai ny ung ty htong ko mina. <verse eid="MRK 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 6:18" />Napei hai pei kacy, Baptisma Johan hmat Heroda hkam, “Ynhnau hai ju hym yn kxn mih cy rata hly nokamlau!” peipa jok miluk na.<verse eid="MRK 6:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 6:19" />Pei miluk Herodi cy Johan hym ty hrak-yk ny pahtyk hym mih hia; pei kapo Heroda nona kacy nohai pahtyk mina. <verse eid="MRK 6:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 6:20" />Pei kapo Johan cy imi hnai, syr mih imi jua na, pei mih cy Heroda tuk miluk mi hym kram ty tamu ny, kry hnaipxng mina. Heroda cy hkri-par ra-ui kaling mih ning hka po, Johan hai txr mih klysai si hym kalum prai mihly keng jojo mina.<verse eid="MRK 6:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 6:21" />Hnakacy Heroda hym hkeu mih ning kalyp mih ni hka cy, Herodi hai kavui kavo mih ning katym mina. Pei mih ni hka cy Kalile pre hai py lu mih si, he lu kye kyk mih si hak tamu ve mih imi kye si hym hpau mihka, py pawi ny hking jok jak cak mina. <verse eid="MRK 6:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 6:22" />Pei mihka Herodi hai tama<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6.22 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">6.14</char><char style="fq" closed="false">Herodi hai tama; </char><char style="ft" closed="false">kawt mih kei ty rut hly mih ca-uk si luk cy </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Herodi hmat hai tama.</char></note> cy ra ny plai jok kacy, Heroda hak hmat hai pin byrbyr si hai ra-ui hym hrakpau jok mina. Hnakacy sangmrang hmat, “Yn hia na va? Yn leng mih si hnget ang jok yn hym,” peipa jok mina. <verse eid="MRK 6:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 6:23" />Pei mikum mi katung hkam hlx jok bei mih cy, “Yn leng kacy ang hai pyng mih pre kahxp mateng po, jok yn hym,” peipa jok mina.<verse eid="MRK 6:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 6:24" />Mi katung cy kai kanu hkam ny, “Ang leng na hym va?” pei htim jok ky.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 6:24">Kanu hmat, “Leng Baptisma Johan hai lu hym a,” peipa jok mina.<verse eid="MRK 6:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 6:25" />Mi katung cy kanup kai sangmrang hkam prawt ny, “Baptisma Johan hai lu hym ty cami samtang nxi ny, hmatca sxn nang ang hkam!” peipa mina.<verse eid="MRK 6:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 6:26" />Hnakacy Sangmrang cy hkri-par ra-ui nohnai mina. Pei kapo hmat hai pin si byrbyr nga hmathmat kadok ty hkik mih kly luk, mi katung hai leng mih cy nohai pahlai jok mina. <verse eid="MRK 6:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 6:27" />Hnakacy Heroda sangmrang hmat Johan hai lu hym sxn nang hym mih he jua hym jok amik ny hrua mina. Y-mi he cy kai htong ko ny, klyk Johan hai lu hym mina. <verse eid="MRK 6:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 6:28" />Y-mi lu hym cy sxn nang samtang luk ny, ryk jok mi katung hkam mina. Mi katung po patyng jok jok kanu hkam bei mina. <verse eid="MRK 6:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 6:29" />Hnakacy Johan hai tabei si cy mi satang hym tuk mihka ra va ny, mi hai vak hym paw ny hpum va kom ko mina.<verse eid="MRK 6:29" /></para>
  <para style="s">Isu Hking Imi Ngau Sang jua Mih</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 14:13-21">Mahtai 14.13–21</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:10-17">Luka 9.10–17</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 6:1-14">Johan 6.1–14</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 6:30" />Rahmang si cy katym va Isu hkam tyng ny, hmatva hai py nana mih sai si hak txr riu mih byrbyr si hym kamtei jok va hmat hkam mina. <verse eid="MRK 6:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 6:31" />Hnakacy sxn cyng kanup cawn mih imi si ve rahjak jua hnak miluk ny, Isu hak hmat hai tabei si cy ca cak hym mi-par po nokaman hnak mina. Pei miluk hmat cy misi hkam, “I cy ihmat si klai pet ve kai ny, mua ryk kanawn i rih mo,” peipa jok mina. <verse eid="MRK 6:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 6:32" />Hnakacy misi cy imi si sxp pei mih tym tum kai va long hly mina.<verse eid="MRK 6:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 6:33" />Misi pei kai mih cy imi rahjak jua si hmat ki ny, Isu hak tabei si na, pei mih tuk va mina. Pei miluk mary si kenjam ve mih imi byrybr si cy pjung hmang va pang htang mihka, Isu hak tabei si nokatym mihmat, katym kai ri htang vit mina. <verse eid="MRK 6:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 6:34" />Hnakacy Isu cy long ko hai kahtxp mihka kaprem hnak mih imi mahu si hym ki kacy, kry mih tun nove mih beram si hto kayng miluk ny, hmat cy misi hym hkri-par van mina. Hnakacy hmat cy misi hym txr riu jok rahjak hnak mina. <verse eid="MRK 6:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 6:35" />Hnakacy jak htang tabei si cy kai hmat hkam ny, “Cami tum cy imi si nove mih tym na; mu po mu ryp hym ky. <verse eid="MRK 6:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 6:36" />Imi si cy kenjam ve mih nam si, lei bawk si tum kai ny hmatva ca hym mih nana hlykhlyk ran hym mih hrua cx rih,” pei txr jok mina.<verse eid="MRK 6:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 6:37" />Pei kapo Isu hmat misi hkam, “Misi ca hym mih jok ynni hmat hkam hai va” peipa jok mina.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 6:37">Pei mihka tabei si hmat, “I cy denarih pasa<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6.37 </char><char style="fk" closed="false">denarih pasa: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Klap cy imi jua hai py tok ni mih hrung na (jau </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="MAT 20:2">Mah 20.2</ref></char>).</note> presum hrung hly ran jok kom ny, hking jok misi hym kla hym ma?” pei hlx va mina.<verse eid="MRK 6:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 6:38" />Hnakacy Isu hmat, “Ynni hkam kom ve nʼhkyt hpe va? Kai ny jua va rih,” peipa jok mina.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 6:38">Misi cy kai ny jau va mihka kacy, “kom ngau hpe hak lam pre mei cy ve,” peipa mina.<verse eid="MRK 6:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 6:39" />Hnakacy Isu cy imi byrbyr si hym hring vexr mih mʼpawi prang tum kamkawm cym jok hym mih txr jok tabei si hkam mina. <verse eid="MRK 6:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 6:40" />Pei mihka imi si cy sum jua, ngaukawt jua, kahkxng cym jok mina. <verse eid="MRK 6:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 6:41" />Hnakacy Isu cy kom ngau hpe hak lam pre mei hym paw ny, kamyng jua lamuk htang mihly, Tamuk hkam txr kalum kly mikum, kawm hym pek dawk pek dawk ny, ret jok imi mahu si hkam hym mih ryk jok hmat hai tabei si hkam mina. Lam pre mei hym po misi byrbyr hkam ret jok mina. <verse eid="MRK 6:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 6:42" />Hnakacy imi byrbyr si cy ca kabym va hpang mina. <verse eid="MRK 6:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 6:43" />Hnakacy tabei si cy katy mih kom hak lam si hai li-hmon hym pakxm ny, katek prelai bem tyng mina. <verse eid="MRK 6:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 6:44" />Ca kom mih imi cy, kaku ngai hmat ve ngau sang hym mina.<verse eid="MRK 6:44" /></para>
  <para style="s">Isu Hmang Tui nxi Mih</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 14:22-33">Mahtai 14.22–33</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 6:15-21">Johan 6.15–21</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="MRK 6:45" />Hnakacy Isu cy imi byrbyr si hym hlawi jok kim htang ny, pei mihka hmat hai tabei si hym cy katang jok long hlyk ko mihka, ve ang pang mih Besada mary htang tapyng jok ri mina. <verse eid="MRK 6:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MRK 6:46" />Hnakacy hmat cy imi mahu si hym kla jok kly hnai mikum, pycuk hym mih pxr kai hrxng htang mina. <verse eid="MRK 6:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MRK 6:47" />Hnakacy jak htang rasa nʼklxm mih ning katym mihka, long cy ve ang vihung tum ny, Isu cy hmat mahlyk ve pang htang jo mina. <verse eid="MRK 6:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MRK 6:48" />Tim nolengsang miluk ny, tabei si cy tapai hai hpo mih ki kacy, hmat cy tui nxi hmang mihka kai misi hkam mina. Ning cy ngxr htyi htyi prongpreng mih ning na. Hmathmat cy misi hym pxt hmang kai<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6.48 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">pxt hmang kai; </char><char style="ft" closed="false">nona kacy </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">misi hak tym.</char></note> vit hym mih lan mina. <verse eid="MRK 6:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="MRK 6:49" />Pei kapo tabei si cy hmat hym hmang ve tui nxi mih ki va kacy, “Y-mi cy casi-uimuk ky!” pei ot lap va mina. <verse eid="MRK 6:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="MRK 6:50" />Misi byrbyr cy ki va hmat hym mihka, katyr va miluk na.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 6:50">Pei mihka Isu hmat pring prawt ny, “bongpa kamawn vah! Ang htung, bongpa kram va!” peipa jok mina.<verse eid="MRK 6:50" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="MRK 6:51" />Hnakacy hmat cy misi ve mih long luk katang kacy, tim cy kanawn ryp mina. Misi cy hkri-par lx va kawrkawr mina. <verse eid="MRK 6:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="MRK 6:52" />Napei hai pei kacy imi si cy, kom hai hlongsai hym notuk kako mihmat misi hai ra-ui cy hkri-par pumpau hnak mina.<verse eid="MRK 6:52" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kenesaret Mary mih Rau si hym Isu Py Hnai Mih</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 14:34-36">Mahtai 14.34–36</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="MRK 6:53" />Hnakacy misi cy ang pang htang kapyng va ny, katym va Kanesaret mary kacy, long hym tan ty va tuitom mina. <verse eid="MRK 6:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="MRK 6:54" />Misi cy kahtxp long ko hai kacy, hmathmat hym hmar va prawt ryp mina. <verse eid="MRK 6:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="MRK 6:55" />Hnakacy misi cy pjung kai va kenjam ve mih kxp tymkor si tum ny, imi rau si hym mʼbai hly krxk kakryng sxn nang va hmat hkam mina. <verse eid="MRK 6:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="MRK 6:56" />Hnakacy Isu hmat katym mih mary po, nam tum po, bawk tai tum po, ci tum po, hmat hai kai mih kxp tymkor tum cy imi rau si hym lang ty va mʼhma tum mina. Hmat hai lungki-hur tom hym kabet hxn hym mih leng va mina. Kabet mih si hnget cy rau hnai ryp, ryp mina.<verse eid="MRK 6:56" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="MRK 7" />
  <para style="s">Kapu kapi si hai Rata Pxntei si</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 15:1-9">Mahtai 15.1–9</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 7:1" />Hparisai si hak Jerusalem mary hai katym ra mih kawt mih tuk Rata mih sara si cy kapluk ra va Isu hkam mina. <verse eid="MRK 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 7:2" />Hmat hai tabei kawt mih si cy nohria rut mihmat nosyr mih rut hly hkam ca va hkamcak mih ki va mina.<verse eid="MRK 7:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 7:3" />(Hparisai si hak Juda ceng byrbyr si cy kani la katang si hai riu ty mih rata pxn si hym kariu tong mina. Misi cy nohria rut ri mihmat noca vai. <verse eid="MRK 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 7:4" />Hnakacy ci hai ran nang mih nana si hym po, ri hmat nohpeu kacy noca va mina.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7.4 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">ci hai ran nang mih nana si hym po, ri hmat nohpeu kacy noca va mina; </char><char style="ft" closed="false">nona kacy </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">hmatva hmat po ri hmat nokahluk tui kacy noca va mina.</char></note> Pu, hkap, samtang, kapria pu si hak kadang<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7.4 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Kawt mih kei ty rut hly mih ca-uk si luk cy </char><char style="fq" closed="false">kadang; </char><char style="ft" closed="false">pei mih nove.</char></note> si po hpeu mih pxn si tong va mina.)<verse eid="MRK 7:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 7:5" />Hnakacy Hparisai si hak tuk Rata mih sara si cy Isu hkam, “Napei hai mih yn hai tabei si cy, kani la katang si hai riu ty mih Rata si hym notong mihmat nosyr mih rut hly napei hkam ca let va?” pei hlx va mina.<verse eid="MRK 7:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 7:6" />Isu hmat misi hkam, “ahmo Isaia hmat ynni py ku mih si hai satang kei ty mih cy rui hkyp ky! Ynni py ku mih si:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 7:6">“ ‘Mi imi si cy hmatva hai hni hly ngai ang hym ty tamu va mina.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MRK 7:6">Pei kapo hmatva hai ra-ui cy ang hly hla mina.<verse eid="MRK 7:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 7:7" />Misi cy imi hai rata si hym Tamuk hai klysai hto txr riu va let,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MRK 7:7">pei miluk ny misi hmat cuk ang hym mih cy atxtx htung!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MRK 7:7">pei mih baibu luk kei ty mihto ateng na.’<verse eid="MRK 7:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 7:8" />“Ynni cy Tamuk hai jok mih kly cy ynni hnong ty klak ny, imi si hai riu mih rata pxn si hym ynni tong va let,” peipa jok mina.<verse eid="MRK 7:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 7:9" />Hnakacy Isu hmat misi hym, “Ynni cy ynni hmat riu mih rata klysai si hym parui jo hym mih Tamuk hai jok mih kly hym ynni nohia let mih cy, ynni cy hkri-par tuk kyk let hai ky! <verse eid="MRK 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 7:10" />Mosi hai rata cy, ‘Ynni hai kanu kapa hym ty tamu va, mimi po na nahky kanu kapa hym htok bak mih mi cy pahtyk takengkek hym mikla,’ peipa jok mina. <verse eid="MRK 7:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 7:11" />Pei kapo ynni cy, sawm kanu kapa hym mih vonsai ve tok kapo, y-mi vonsai si hlu Tamuk hkam hpyk kacy sawm kanu kapa hym mih nohia lyng ky pei pacyng va ny, ‘Mi cy Corban,’ (pei mih sai cy, Tamuk hai vonsai si) pei ny, <verse eid="MRK 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 7:12" />pei mih ynni cy sawm kanu kapa hym mih aly nohia, pei txr riu va let mina. <verse eid="MRK 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 7:13" />Ynni cy ynni hai txr riu mih pxn hmat, Tamuk hai klysai hym kahma jok vit ky. Yng mihto bet mih rata pxn si po ynni tong mih ve rahjak hin,” peipa jok mina.<verse eid="MRK 7:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nosyr jok Imi hym Mih Nana si</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 15:10-20">Mahtai 15.10–20</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 7:14" />Hnakacy Isu cy imi mahu si hym hpau hmat hkam bei ny, “Ynni byrbyr cy keng ang hai kly hym ny tuk kako va. <verse eid="MRK 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 7:15" />Kum htang hai kanup ra ko mih cy, nosyr jok imi hym mih si na po nove lyng; Imi mu ko hai cawn ra mih si neni imi hym nosyr jok haihtung peipa jok mina.” <verse eid="MRK 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" pubnumber="[16]" sid="MRK 7:16" /><note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7.16 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Kawt mih kei ty rut hly mih ca-uk si luk cy cem 16: </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Mimi po keng hym taram ve mih mi cy tuk nahky! </char><char style="ft" closed="false">pei kei ty mina (jau </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="MRK 4:23">4.23</ref></char>).</note><verse eid="MRK 7:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 7:17" />Hnakacy hmat cy imi mahu si long hai cawn kai vit ny, kanup kai kimko mihka tabei si hmat cy, hmat txr jok mih kanyk kly hai hlongsai hym hlx va mina. <verse eid="MRK 7:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 7:18" />Isu hmat misi hkam, “Yng miryk par po ynni notuk hpyhlak jo hin ma? Kum htang kanup kaw ko mih si nget cy imi hym nosyr jok mih nona lyng. <verse eid="MRK 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 7:19" />Napei hai pei kacy, y-mi si cy kanup imi hai ra-ui ko mih nona lyng; kanup mu ko mih cy plau kai mahkung jan ny cawn kai kale htang pxn hai htung,” pei mih hkamcak si byrbyr cy syr htung pei plim txr jok mina.<verse eid="MRK 7:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 7:20" />Hnakacy hmat cy misi hkam txr jok bei mih cy, “Imi mu ko hai cawn ra mih neni imi hym nosyr jok mina. <verse eid="MRK 7:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 7:21" />Napei hai pei kacy, nohnai mih tau si, py mahyng mih si, py luku mih si, kur kyng imi hym mih si cy ra-ui ko hai cawn ra reng ny; <verse eid="MRK 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 7:22" />imi si hai tahi ju hym py tahmang mih, hampa mih, ra-ui nget mih si, pawp cai mih, nohia jau mih, txr cyk mih, kamlx kam-yk mih hak nokai tum-ai mih si cy imi ra-ui ko hai cawn ra mina. <verse eid="MRK 7:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 7:23" />Pei nohnai mih nana si cy, imi ko hai cawn ra ny imi hym nosyr jok mih,” peipa jok mina.<verse eid="MRK 7:23" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kacai jua hai Ybra</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 15:21-28">Mahtai 15.21–28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 7:24" />Hnakacy Isu cy y-mi tum hai cawn kai ny, kai Tura mary htang mina. Hmat cy kanup kim hlyk ko ny, hmat katym mih cy, mimi hym po nohia jok tuk mina. Pei kapo hmat cy kahrxm hym mih nohai man. <verse eid="MRK 7:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 7:25" />Limla-ui kajung mih kacai raca jua hai kanu cy, tuk Isu hai satang hym miluk ra prawt ny, hmathmat hai hkawk tut tum kabawk mina. <verse eid="MRK 7:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 7:26" />Mi kacai cy Krip ceng Suri pre hai kacai na ny, hmat cy Jenta ceng na. Mi kacai cy hmat hai tama hkam kajung mih limla-ui hym pahtok paivit hym mih Isu hkam kahui mihly leng mina. <verse eid="MRK 7:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 7:27" />Pei kapo Isu hmat, “Tahi tahnau si hym kabym mipar hking kai ri vit hym hin. Tahi tahnau si hai ca mih cak hym paw kai vit ny jok kui si hym let mih cy nokavo lyng,” pei htim jok mina.<verse eid="MRK 7:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 7:28" />Mi kacai hmat, “Rui htung Malai, pei kapo hkung kly mih tahi si hai ca mih cakty cakna si hym cy kui si po ca mih ve reng htung,” peipa jok mina.<verse eid="MRK 7:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 7:29" />Pei mihka Isu hmat mi kacai hym, “Yn hai htimplang nang mih kly luk, hlawi kai kim hmat a; limla-ui cy yn hai tama hkam hai cawn kaivit ky,” peipa jok mina.<verse eid="MRK 7:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 7:30" />Hnakacy mi kacai cy katym hmat nam mihka, limla-ui cawn kaivit miluk ny, tama micy kalang ve kadang nxi mih kakrum mina.<verse eid="MRK 7:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Taram pang Kly-a hym Isu Py Hnai Mih</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 15:21-28">Mahtai 15.21–28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 7:31" />Hnakacy Isu cy Tura mary hak Sidom mary hai cawn ny, Dikapoli ne long hmang kai prek ny, katym Kalile Ang mina. <verse eid="MRK 7:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 7:32" />Kawt mih imi si hmat taram po pang kly-a mih imi jua hym ong nang Isu hkam ny, mi imi hym klyng jok rut hym mih kahui leng va Isu hkam mina. <verse eid="MRK 7:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 7:33" />Isu cy mi imi hym imi mahu si long hai pet hpua kai ny, hmathmat hai rutlxng hym cy hrua jok mi imi hai taram kim ko mina. Hnakacy kria tui hly mi imi hai lai tum po htuk jok mina. <verse eid="MRK 7:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 7:34" />Hnakacy Isu cy hx hrak-la hpxng mihly kamyng lamuk htang ny, “Ehpata,” peipa jok mina. Y-mi cy, “Kaplor hai!” pei mih sai na.<verse eid="MRK 7:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 7:35" />Hnakacy mi imi hai taram pang cy kaplor ny, mi hai kly ah mih lai po kaplang miluk py kly cakbeng prawt ryp mina. <verse eid="MRK 7:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 7:36" />Isu hmat pei mih satang hym cy, mimi hkam po notxr hym mih imi si hym txr ty hrxk mina. Pei kapo hmat cy paka tok kapo, imi si cy y-mi satang hym kahtyi jok rat mina. <verse eid="MRK 7:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 7:37" />Y-mi satang hym tuk mih imi byrbyr si cy hkri-par lx va hnak ny, “Hmat cy na conghkang si hym hkri-par py jok hnai ky! Taram pang mih si hym taram au jok ky; kly-a mih si hym po hai py jok kly htai ky!” pei txr jok va mina.<verse eid="MRK 7:37" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="MRK 8" />
  <para style="s">Imi Liu Sang jua hym Isu Hking Mih</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 15:32-39">Mahtai 15.32–39</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 8:1" />Pei mihka nona ok-ai mih imi mahu si cy kapluk ra va bei ny, misi cy nasai po ca hym mih nove miluk, Isu cy hpau hmathmat hai tabei si hym ny, <verse eid="MRK 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 8:2" />“Mi imi si cy hrum ni txptxp ve ang hly tym mina. Hmatca misi cy ca hym mih na sai po nove miluk, ang cy misi hym hkri-par van mina. <verse eid="MRK 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 8:3" />Kawt mih imi si cy katym ra pin hla hai miluk, misi hym nasai po nohking mihmat hlawi jok kacy, mʼhma tare hra bai va hym,” peipa jok mina.<verse eid="MRK 8:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 8:4" />Tabei si hmat cy, “Mi imi si ca kabym hpang mipar hkam ca hym mih cami kale long tum napei man yngham htang hai hym va?” pei htim jok mina.<verse eid="MRK 8:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 8:5" />Isu hmat misi hkam, “Ynni hkam kom ve nʼhkyt hpe va?” pei hlx jok mina.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 8:5">Tabei si hmat, “Kom ve ranit hpe,” pei htim jok mina.<verse eid="MRK 8:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 8:6" />Pei mihka hmat cy imi mahu si hym cym jok bon tum mikum, paw kom ranit hpe hym ny Tamuk hkam txr kalum kly mina. Hnakacy kom hym pekdok pekdok ny, ret jok imi mahu si hkam hym mih ryk jok hmat hai tabei si hkam mina. Tabei si hmat po ret jok imi mahu si hym mina. <verse eid="MRK 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 8:7" />Hnakacy misi hkam lam le po ve cx ny; Isu cy Tamuk hkam txr kalum kly mikum, mi lam hym po ret jok imi si hym mih hmat hai tabei si hym ryk jok mina. <verse eid="MRK 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 8:8" />Imi si cy ca va kabym hpang va mina. Mikum katy mih li-hmon si hym pakxm cawm ny katek ranit bem tyng mina. <verse eid="MRK 8:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 8:9" />Ca kom mih imi si cy ve liu sang jua bah tamu hym. Pei mikum Isu hmat imi si hym y-mi tum hai kapra jok tyng mina. <verse eid="MRK 8:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 8:10" />Hnakacy tabei si hly tym katang kai va long nxi prawt ny, kai va Dalmanuhta pre htang mina.<verse eid="MRK 8:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Hparisai si Leng va Ringrang Kahmar-ra Mih</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 16:1-4">Mahtai 16.1–4</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 8:11" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">8.11 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 12:38">Mah 12.38</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 11:16">Luk 11.16</ref></char>
    </note>Kawt mih Hparisai si cy ra va Isu hkam ny, hmat hly kaklau ka-ek kly mina. Misi cy hkla hmat hym mihly leng va lamuk htang hai kahmar-ra si mina. <verse eid="MRK 8:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 8:12" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8.12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 12:39">Mah 12.39</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 11:29">Luk 11.29</ref></char></note> Pei kapo Isu cy ra-ui nohnai mihly hx hrak la hmat hpxng ny, “Mi amjy cy napei hai mih leng va ringrang kahmar-ra si let va? Ang txr ynni rui hkyp hym: pei mih imi si hkam y-mi ringrang hym notxng jok lyng!” peipa jok mina.<verse eid="MRK 8:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 8:13" />Hmathmat cy mi imi si hkam hai cawn kai mihka katang long ko ny, kapyng va ang pang htang mina.<verse eid="MRK 8:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Hparisai si hak Heroda hai Bur</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 16:5-12">Mahtai 16.5–12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 8:14" />Tabei si cy ca hym kalok mipar sxn nang kom hym mih cy hma kai hmyk va miluk long ko cy kom ve hpe hlyk lei ngai mina. <verse eid="MRK 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 8:15" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8.15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 12:1">Luk 12.1</ref></char></note> Isu hmat misi hkam, “Ynni cy Hparisai si hai bur hak Heroda hai bur si hym cy, kamkxm va,” pei jok ty kly mina.<verse eid="MRK 8:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 8:16" />Tabei si cy, hmatva hkam ca hym mih hkam cak nokapam sxn nang miluk ny pei kaklai katxr kakung nga va mina.<verse eid="MRK 8:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 8:17" />Isu cy misi hai pei karam mih kly hym tuk ny misi hkam, “Ynni cy hkam cak nokapam sxn nang miluk napei ynni hmat tingtawi kaklai katxr ryry let va? Hmatca hkrai ynni notuk jo hin ma? Ynni hai ra-ui cy napei tan ryk pumpau hai va? <verse eid="MRK 8:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 8:18" />Ynni cy mik ve mahko mihmat noki jo hin ma? Taram ve mahko mihmat notuk mih sai ma? <verse eid="MRK 8:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 8:19" />Ang cy kom ngau hpe hly hking imi ngau sang jua mih ynni notuk jo hin ma? Ca katy mih li-hmon si hym pakxm cawm mih katek nʼhkyt bem va?” pei hlx jok mina.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 8:19">Misi hmat cy, “Pakxm prelai bem,” pei htim jok mina.<verse eid="MRK 8:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 8:20" />Isu hmat misi hkam, “Ang cy kom ranit hpe hly imi liu sang jua hym hking mihka katy mih li-hmon si hym pakxm mih katek nʼhkyt bem va?” pei hlx jok mina.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 8:20">Tabei si hmat, “Ranit bem,” pei htim jok va mina.<verse eid="MRK 8:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 8:21" />Isu hmat, “Ynni cy hmatca hkrai notuk kako jo hin ma?” peipa jok mina.<verse eid="MRK 8:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Behtsaida Nam Mikmeng jua hym Isu Py Hnai Mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 8:22" />Hnakacy Isu hak hmat hai tabei cy katym Besada nam mihka, imi si cy mikmeng mih imi jua hym ong nang hmathmat hkam ny, mi hym hnap jok kep hym mih leng va kasawm mina. <verse eid="MRK 8:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 8:23" />Hnakacy Isu cy mikmeng mih imi hai rut hym kamhkawr ny, ong hpau kai nam kum htang vit mina. Pei mihka mi hai mik hym htawk kria tui hly ny, mi nxi klyng jok rut mikum kacy, “Hmatca yn ki nana ky ma?” pei hlx jok mina.<verse eid="MRK 8:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 8:24" />Mi imi cy kamyng jau heteng ny, “Imi si hym ang ki, pei kapo mi si cy hring si hmang mʼhma mihto kayng,” peipa jok mina.<verse eid="MRK 8:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 8:25" />Hnakacy mi hai mik hym typ hnap jok bei ny; pei mihka krajau hra hmat lym kacy, mi imi hai mik cy au kari ateng tyng miluk nana conghkang si hym ki syr ryp mina. <verse eid="MRK 8:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 8:26" />Hnakacy Isu hmat mi imi hkam, “Bongpa kanup nam ko htang,” peipa jok ny, hlawi jok hmat hai kim htang tyng mina.<verse eid="MRK 8:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">Petara hmat Kahtyi jok Isu hai Satang Mih</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 16:13-20">Mahtai 16.13–20</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:18-21">Luka 9.18–21</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 8:27" />Isu cy hmat hai Tabei si hly tym kai va Kaisari Hpilipi kapyng ve mih nam si htang mihka, mʼhma tare hmathmat hai tabei si hkam, “Ang hym imi si hmat miva pei txr va?” pei hlx jok mina.<verse eid="MRK 8:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 8:28" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">8.28 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MRK 6:14">Mrk 6.14</ref>,<ref loc="MRK 6:15">15</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:7">Luk 9.7</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 9:8">8</ref></char>
    </note> Misi hmat, “Kawt mih imi si hmat cy yn cy Baptisma Johan; bet mih si hmat cy Elija; kawt mih si cy Ahmo si long hai juajua na, pei mih po txr va,” pei htim jok va mina.<verse eid="MRK 8:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 8:29" />Pei mihka hmathmat cy, “Ynni hmat sie ang hym miva pei txr hym va?” pei hlx jok mina.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 8:29">Petara hmat, “Yn cy Messiah ky,” pei htim jok mina.<verse eid="MRK 8:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 8:30" />Isu hmat misi hkam, “Ang cy mimi na, pei mih mimi hkam po bongpa htyi-a txr va a,” pei mih hmat hai tabei si hkam jok ty kly mina.<verse eid="MRK 8:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Isu hmathmat Nang mira hak Htyk hym mih Satang</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 16:21-28">Mahtai 16.21–28</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:22-27">Luka 9.22–27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 8:31" />Isu hamt, “Imi hai Tahi cy tongnang mira si hkri-par kakrum hym py kamkawm lu mih katang si, pahtyp tun lu si, tuk Rata mih sara si hmat nohia va jau ny, pahtyk va hym mina. Pei kapo hrum ni luk cy rx tyng hym,” pei mih satang cy hmat hai tabei si hkam kahang txr jok mina. <verse eid="MRK 8:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 8:32" />Hmathmat cy pei mih satang hym txr jok laklap miluk, Petara cy hmat hym pet hpau kai bet htang mihka pring ngak mina. <verse eid="MRK 8:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 8:33" />Pei kapo hmat cy kaplang jau tabei si hym mihly Petara hkam, “Satan, ang hkam hai cawn kaivit; yn hai kako mih cy Tamuk hai rahjak htang nona, imi hai rahjak htung!” pei pring ngak mina.<verse eid="MRK 8:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 8:34" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">8.34 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 10:38">Mah 10.38</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 14:27">Luk 14.27</ref></char>
    </note> Hnakacy Isu cy hmat hai tabei si hak imi mahu si hym hpau hmathmat hkam ny, “Mimi po na nahky hia ang kung kajun kacy ihmat hai rahjak hym hjy ty klak ny, ihmat hai hkraws hym kawt mihly kajun ang kung hym mih kla. <verse eid="MRK 8:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 8:35" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8.35 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 10:39">Mah 10.39</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 17:33">Luk 17.33</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 12:25">Jhn 12.25</ref></char></note> Mimi po ihmat hai hringvek hym hau kahlawira mih imi cy hringvek kasum hym; mimi po anghmat hak satang hnai hai kavui ihmat hai hringvek kasum mih imi cy man kaklangra hym. <verse eid="MRK 8:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 8:36" />Imi cy lamuk bon dyk hym pyng tok kapo ihmat hai limla hringvek kasum kacy na kamran ve hym va? <verse eid="MRK 8:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 8:37" />Ihmat hai limla hringvek hym hkymhai kaklang na hly hym va? <verse eid="MRK 8:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 8:38" />Napei hai pei kacy, hmatca mih ning yb tahmang mih kamngo si hly nokai rui mih imi, mi po na nahky, ang hak ang hai klysai hym pru mina. Imi hai Tahi cy lamuk nam ve mih Kapa hai hpum-ang hak, angel syr si hly tym kahtxp ra mihka, y-mi imi hym pru tyng ria hym,” peipa jok mina.<verse eid="MRK 8:38" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="MRK 9" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 9:1" />Mikum hmat cy misi hkam, “Ang txr ynni hkyp hym, Tamuk hai Pyng mira cy hpum tako hly kahtxp ra mih noki mihmat cy, cami tum ve mih kawt mih imi si cy htyk hym mih nona,” peipa jok mina.<verse eid="MRK 9:1" /></para>
  <para style="s">Isu hai Klang Pet kaivit Mih</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 17:1-13">Mahtai 17.1–13</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:28-36">Luka 9.28–36</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 9:2" />Ruk ni kum kacy Isu cy Petara, Jakob, Johan si hym hpau ny, hmatva klai cyng pxr va hrxng hrau nxi htang mina. Pei mihka misi nga Isu hai klang cy pet kai vit mina. <verse eid="MRK 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 9:3" />Hmat hai hkuk-xk po kok mih sai au tong hnak ny, yng miryk bonpre hai imi si mimi po nohai sop-hnet lek mipar kok au tong hnak mina. <verse eid="MRK 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 9:4" />Hnakacy tabei hrum jua si nga Elija hak Mosi cy katxng ra ny, Isu hly tym karam va kly mina. <verse eid="MRK 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 9:5" />Hnakacy Petara hmat Isu hkam, “Malai, cami tum cy i ve hym mih tym hnai prai! Yn hmat hai kavui tai hlyk, Mosi hai kavui tai hlyk, Elija hai kavui tai hlyk, i py jok tai hrum hym ca,” peipa jok mina. <verse eid="MRK 9:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 9:6" />Tabei si cy hkri-par kram va miluk ny, Petara cy txr na hym bah pei mih notuk miluk, pei lila txr jok mina.<verse eid="MRK 9:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 9:7" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">9.7 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 3:17">Mah 3.17</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:11">Mrk 1.11</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 3:22">Luk 3.22</ref></char>
    </note>Hnakacy nua sau mih cy misi hym plum kai hmyk ny, “Cami cy ang hai hkrei mih Tahi na mi hai kly hym keng va!” pei mih nua ko hai kly txn katym ra mina. <verse eid="MRK 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 9:8" />Pei mihka tabei si cy kaplang jau num tok kapo hmatva hly tym ve mih Isu hym ngai kum kacy mimi hym po noki va.<verse eid="MRK 9:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 9:9" />Hnakacy tabei si cy hrxng htang hai sxn kahtxp va htxm mihka Isu hmat, “Hmatca ynni ki mih nana si hym cy, Imi hai Tahi htyk mikum norx tyng miryk cy mimi hkam po bongpa txr jok va,” pei jok ty kly mina.<verse eid="MRK 9:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 9:10" />Tabei si cy hmat hai kly hym patawm ny, “Htyk mira hai rx tyng hym pei mih cy txr na hai va?” pei ny hmatva tingtawi kahlx karam va mina. <verse eid="MRK 9:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 9:11" />Hnakacy misi hmat Isu hkam, “Tuk Rata mih sara si hmat cy Elija kahtxp ra ri hym, pei mih cy napei hai va?” pei hlx va mina.<verse eid="MRK 9:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 9:12" />Pei mihka misi hkam, “Na conghkang py ty yp hym mih Elija ra ri mih cy rui htung. Pei kapo Baibu hmat txr mih cy, Imi hai Tahi cy tongnang mira hak imi si hmat nohia jau mih po kakrum hym, pei kei ty mih cy napei hai va? <verse eid="MRK 9:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 9:13" />Pei kapo ang txr ynni hym, Elija cy katym ra vit ky. Baibu hmat txr ty mih ateng, imi si cy hmat hym hia py mih si hnget py hpyk hai ky,” peipa jok mina.<verse eid="MRK 9:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kajung Raca hkam Mih Limla-ui hym Isu Py Hnai Mih</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 17:14-21">Mahtai 17.14–21</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:37-43">Luka 9.37–43</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 9:14" />Hnakacy misi cy bet mih tabei si ve mih tum katym va mihka, imi mahu si cy tabei si hym kua cym ve num mihak kawt mih tuk Rata mih sara si hly ka-ek kaklau va mina. <verse eid="MRK 9:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 9:15" />Imi mahu si cy ki Isu hym mihka, hkri-par lx va mihly, pjung ra va hmathmat hkam ny kalum va hmathmat hym mina. <verse eid="MRK 9:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 9:16" />Isu hmat tabei si hkam, “Ynni cy misi hly ka-ek kaklau va na satang si hai va?” pei hlx jok mina.<verse eid="MRK 9:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 9:17" />Mahu si long hai imi jua cy hmathmat hkam, “Sara jyi, kly-a mih limla-ui kajung mih ang hai tahi hym ang ong hpau nang yn hkam hai ky. <verse eid="MRK 9:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 9:18" />Mi cy limla-ui kajung mihka kacy, katim bon txr ny, kalak htang hai kria pawp si cawn mihly tai jxng si mina. Pei mikum mi hai nga cy hkyr-vehkyt hnak mina. Mi limla-ui hym pahtok kai vit hym mih yn hai tabei si hkam ang kamtei jok kapo misi cy nohai pahtok nang,” pei kamte txr jok mina.<verse eid="MRK 9:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 9:19" />Isu hmat misi hkam, “Ybra nove mih amjy si! Ynni hly tym ang ve jok ynghak ryk hym va? Ynni hym ynghak ryk kahkam jok hym va? Raca hym hpau nang ang hkam va!” peipa jok mina. <verse eid="MRK 9:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 9:20" />Hnakacy misi cy raca hym ong jok Isu hkam mina.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 9:20">Limla-ui cy ki Isu hym mihak, raca hym cy hkri-par kajyng jok ny kalak htang hia kria pawp cawn mihly, katim kapleng ve bon klak mina. <verse eid="MRK 9:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 9:21" />Isu hmat, “Mi raca pei kajyng mih cy kakra ky ma?” pei hlx jok kapa hkam mina.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 9:21">Kapa hmat, “Raca loi hka hai kaso ky peipa jok mina. <verse eid="MRK 9:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 9:22" />Limla-ui cy raca hym pahtyk hym mih hmai tum hak, tui tum katim jok avor hnak mina. Yn hmat hkym py jok htai mane cy, i hym van ny sawm nang cx a!” pei kamtei jok mina.<verse eid="MRK 9:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 9:23" />Isu hmat misi hkam, “Yn hmat hkym py jok htai mane cy, pei mih yn napei txr hai mi! Yb mih imi cy na conghkang si nohai py mih nove lyng,” peipa jok mina.<verse eid="MRK 9:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 9:24" />Raca hai kapa hmat, “Ang yb hkyp htung hmang. Pei kapo ang hai ybra hra di miluk sawm nang ang hym cx rih!” pei ot mihly kamtei jok mina.<verse eid="MRK 9:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 9:25" />Hnakacy Isu cy imi mahu si karung pjung ra hmat hkam mih ki kacy limla-ui hkam, “Kly-a taram pang mih limla, ang jok yn amik, raca hkam hia cawn kai, ynghak hka po bongpa kanup tyng bei ky!” pei ngak jok mina.<verse eid="MRK 9:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 9:26" />Pei mihka limla-ui cy raca hym lap mihly hkri-par kajyng jok mikum mi hkam hai cawn kai vit mina. Hnakacy raca cy htyk mihto ve jxjx hnak miluk imi si hmat, “Raca cy htyk hai ky!” pei txr va mina. <verse eid="MRK 9:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 9:27" />Pei kapo Isu hmat mi raca hai rut hym kamhkawr mihka krxng ny, mi cy rx ryp mina.<verse eid="MRK 9:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 9:28" />Mikum Isu cy kanup kim mihka, tabei si hmat, “I cy y-mi limla hym napei mih nohai pahtok hai va?” pei hlx va jxn mina.<verse eid="MRK 9:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 9:29" />Isu hmat misi hkam, “Yng mi cy kawng cak mihly pycuk mira nona kacy, ynghak hka po nohai pahtok lyng,” peipa jok mina.<verse eid="MRK 9:29" /></para>
  <para style="s">Isu Hmathmat Htyk hym Mih Satang Txr jok bei Mih</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 17:22-23">Mahtai 17.22–23</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:43b-45">Luka 9.43b–45</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 9:30" />Isu hak hmat hai tabei si cy y-mi tum hai cawn va mikum, Kalile pre htang hmang kai va prek mina. Hmat cy pei hmang kai prek mih satang hym mimi hkam po tuk hym mih nohia jok. <verse eid="MRK 9:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 9:31" />Napei hai pei kacy, hmat hai tabei si hkam, “Imi hai Tahi cy imi si hai rut luk kahnap hym ny, pahtyk va hym. Pei kapo hrum ni luk cy htyk mira hai rx tyng hym,” pei txr ty miluk na.<verse eid="MRK 9:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 9:32" />Pei kapo misi cy hmat hai txr mih klysai hym notuk va keng, hlx hmathmat hkam tyng hym mih po kram va ny novam mina.<verse eid="MRK 9:32" /></para>
  <para style="s">Miva Kye kyk va?</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 18:1-5">Mahtai 18.1–5</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:46-48">Luka 9.46–48</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 9:33" />Isu cy hmat hai tabei si hak katym va Kapernaum mary ny, kanup kim mihka Isu hmat, “Mʼhma yh ynni ka-ek na satang si hai va?” pei hlx jok tabei si hkam mina.<verse eid="MRK 9:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 9:34" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">9.34 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LUK 22:24">Luk 22.24</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Pei kapo misi cy krxp po notxn va. Txr kacy, hmatva long miva kye kyk va, pei mih mʼhma yh juajua ka-ek kaklau va miluk na. <verse eid="MRK 9:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 9:35" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9.35 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 20:26">Mah 20.26</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 20:27">27</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 23:11">23.11</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:43">Mrk 10.43</ref>,<ref loc="MRK 10:44">44</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:26">Luk 22.26</ref></char></note>Hnakacy Isu cy cym ny, hpau prelai jua mih tabei si hym mihka misi hkam, “Mimi po hia ri htang ve kyk mih imi cy, ve kungbxng tum hym mikla. Ve Imi byrbyr si hai cinrx hym,” peipa jok mina. <verse eid="MRK 9:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 9:36" />Hnakacy hmathmat cy hpau raca jua hym ny, jyng jok misi nga mihka raca hym rut hly plau lawi ny misi hkam, <verse eid="MRK 9:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 9:37" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9.37 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 10:40">Mah 10.40</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 10:16">Luk 10.16</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 13:20">Jhn 13.20</ref></char></note>“Mimi po ang hai ming hly, yngmi raca jua hym vyn mih imi cy vyn ang hym mina. Ang hym vyn mih imi cy ang hym vyn mih ngai nona ny, ang hym hrua mih tun hym po vyn hai ky,” peipa jok mina.<verse eid="MRK 9:37" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nokakei i hym Mih Mi cy Kapy I htang Mih</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 9:49-50">Luka 9.49–50</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 9:38" />Johan hmat, “Sara jyi, yn hai ming hly pahtok limla-ui si hym mih imi jua hym i kakrum mina. Mi cy nokajun i kung miluk ny, mi cy yn hai ming hym notong hym mih ihmat paka jok,” peipa mina.<verse eid="MRK 9:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 9:39" />Isu hmat, “Mi hym bawngpa paka va, ang hai ming hly lx hnai mih ringrang si py mikum, txr cyk ang hym mih imi jua po nove lyng. <verse eid="MRK 9:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 9:40" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9.40 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 12:30">Mah 12.30</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 11:23">Luk 11.23</ref></char></note>I hym nokakei py mih imi cy kapy i htang mih imi na. <verse eid="MRK 9:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 9:41" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9.41 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 10:42">Mah 10.42</ref></char></note>Ang txr ynni rui hkyp hym, Hkrista hai tabei si na pei ny, ang hai ming hly ynni hym jok tui hkap mih imi cy kalum mih hrung man ngui hym.<verse eid="MRK 9:41" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kamngo Parawi Mira si</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 18:6-9">Mahtai 18.6–9</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 17:1-2">Luka 17.1–2</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 9:42" />“Ang hym yb mih, cami raca juajua hym tahmang jok mih imi cy su mi mih hua sum hym xh jok hmat hai ngawng tum ny, var kai panglei ko vit mih cy, hmat hai kavui hnai hkryk hym. <verse eid="MRK 9:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 9:43" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9.43 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 5:30">Mah 5.30</ref></char></note>Yn hai rut hmat tahmang jok yn hym let kacy, y-mi rut hym tan pai tut! Rut kangxm mihly vyng hmai kom miluk cy rut nokangxm mihmat man hringvek mih cy hnai hkryk hin. <verse eid="MRK 9:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" pubnumber="[44]" sid="MRK 9:44" /><note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9.44 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Kawt mih kei ty rut hly mih ca-uk si luk cy cem 44: </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Yn hai hkawk cy yn hai yb mira hym tahmang jok let kacy mi hkawk hym tan pai tut! </char><char style="ft" closed="false">pei kei ty mina.</char></note> <verse eid="MRK 9:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MRK 9:45" />Yn hai hkawk hmat tahmang jok yn hym let kacy mi hkawk hym tan paivit, hkawk kangxm hly vyng hmai kom miluk cy, hkawk nokangxm mihmat man dungjan hringvek mih cy hnai hkryk hin. <verse eid="MRK 9:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" pubnumber="[46]" sid="MRK 9:46" /><note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9.46 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Kawt mih kei ty rut hly mih ca-uk si luk cy cem 46: </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Yn hai mik hmat yn hai yb mira hym tahmang jok let kacy y-mi mik hym lai pai vit! </char><char style="ft" closed="false">pei kei ty mina.</char></note> <verse eid="MRK 9:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MRK 9:47" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9.47 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 5:29">Mah 5.29</ref></char></note>Yn hai mik hmat tahmang jok yn hym let kacy mi mik hym lai paivit, mik kangxm hly vyng hmai kom miluk cy, Tamuk hai Pyng mira tum mik nokangxm mihly man kanup mih cy yn hai kavui hnai hkryk hym. <verse eid="MRK 9:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MRK 9:48" />Y-mi tum cy misi hym ca mih lung si cy nohtyk vai, hmai po norim vai mih tum na.<verse eid="MRK 9:48" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="MRK 9:49" />“Pahtyp mih tawn-ngeng si hym kasyr jok lung hly mihto, imi conghkang si hym kasyr jok hmai hly hym mina.<verse eid="MRK 9:49" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="MRK 9:50" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">9.50 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 5:13">Mah 5.13</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 14:34">Luk 14.34</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 14:35">35</ref></char>
    </note>“Lung cy hnai prai, pei kapo ik sap kaivit kacy, ik mih hlem hym man yngham hai tyng hym va?</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 9:50">“Ynni hmat hkam lung ve ny, ynni hmat tingtawi kaly mira ve nahky,” peipa jok mina.<verse eid="MRK 9:50" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="MRK 10" />
  <para style="s">Kaprai mih Hlongsai Isu hmat Riu Mih</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 19:1-12">Mahtai 19.1–12</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 16:18">Luka 16.18</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 10:1" />Hnakacy Isu cy y-mi tum hai cawn mihka, kai Juda pre htang ny, kapyng Jordan O mina. Imi mahu si cy kapluk ra va hmathmat hkam bei mina. Hmat hai py reng mihto misi hkam txr riu jok mina.<verse eid="MRK 10:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 10:2" />Kawt mih Hparisai si cy ra hmat hkam ny, “Imi cy hmat hai ju hym kaprai mih cy Rata hly hkym kamlau ma?” pei hlx va mina.<verse eid="MRK 10:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 10:3" />Isu hmat misi hkam, “Ynni hkam Mosi hmat napei jok ty kly va?” pei kei hlx jok tyng mina.<verse eid="MRK 10:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 10:4" />Misi hmat, “Jok kaprai ca kacy kaprai ju hly hym mih Mosi hmat cy jok,” peipa va mina.<verse eid="MRK 10:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 10:5" />Isu hmat misi hkam, “Ynni hai ra-ui cy pumpau miluk, Mosi cy pei mih rata klysai si hym kei ty mina. <verse eid="MRK 10:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 10:6" />Pei kapo Tamuk cy cxk-ri hka, py kaku hak kacai hym, pei mih baibu ko txr mina. <verse eid="MRK 10:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 10:7" />Pei miluk, kaku cy hmat hai kanu kapa hym hjy ty klak ny, hmat hai ju hly ve ja tym hym.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10.7 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Kawt mih kei ty rut hly mih ca-uk si luk cy </char><char style="fq" closed="false">hmat hai ju hly ve ja tym hym; </char><char style="ft" closed="false">pei mih nove.</char></note> <verse eid="MRK 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 10:8" />Mija pre jua cy plau ra cak-nga pum hlyk hym, pei miluk kaku hak kacai cy pre jua nona mihmat, jua ngai htung. <verse eid="MRK 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 10:9" />Pei miluk Tamuk hmat sxksan ty mih cy imi hmat bongpa prai nahky,” peipa jok mina.<verse eid="MRK 10:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 10:10" />Hnakacy tabei si cy kanup va kim tyng mihka, y-mi kly hym hlx va Isu hkam mina. <verse eid="MRK 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 10:11" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10.11,12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 5:32">Mah 5.32</ref>; <ref loc="1CO 7:10">1 Kor 7.10</ref>,<ref loc="1CO 7:11">11</ref></char></note>Hmat cy misi hkam, “Mimi po ihmat hai ju hym hjy ty klak ny, bet mih kacai jua hly kapaw mih imi cy, hmat hai ju nxi py mahyng mina. <verse eid="MRK 10:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 10:12" />Yng mihto tyng kacai po hmat hai hua hly kaprai ny bet mih kaku jua hkam py kai hua let kacy, hmat hai hua nxi py mahyng hai ky,” peipa jok mina.<verse eid="MRK 10:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Raca si hym jok Kamhtongra Mih</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 19:13-15">Mahtai 19.13–15</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 18:15-17">Luka 18.15–17</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 10:13" />Kawt mih imi si cy raca si hym klyng rut hym mih ong nang va Isu hkam mina. Pei kapo tabei si cy misi hym pring mina. <verse eid="MRK 10:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 10:14" />Pei mihka Isu ki kacy hrak-kaluk ny tabei si hkam, “Raca si cy ra va ang hkam nahky, bongpa paka va. Tamuk hai Pyng mira cy misi hai kavui na. <verse eid="MRK 10:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 10:15" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10.15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 18:3">Mah 18.3</ref></char></note> Ang txr ynni hkyphkyp hym, yngmi raca jua hai ra-ui hto nove mih imi cy Tamuk hai Pyng mira long noman kanup lyng,” peipa jok. <verse eid="MRK 10:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 10:16" />Hnakacy hmat cy raca si hym loi ny, misi hkam klyng jok rut mihka jokjok kamhtongra mina.<verse eid="MRK 10:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Imi Malai</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 19:16-30">Mahtai 19.16–30</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 18:18-30">Luka 18.18–30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 10:17" />Isu cy hmang mʼhma htxm mihka imi jua cy pjung ra hmathmat hkam mihka sakron kung mihly, “Hnai mih sara, man dungjan hringvek hym mih ang napei py na si kla hym va?” pei hlx jok mina.<verse eid="MRK 10:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 10:18" />Isu hmat mi imi hkam, “Yn cy napei mih ang hym hnai mih sara pei hpau hai va? Tamuk nona kacy py hnai mih imi jua po nove lyng. <verse eid="MRK 10:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 10:19" />‘Bongpa pahtyk imi, mi hai tahi ju hym bongpa py mahyng, bawngpa ku mi hai vonsai, mi hym bongpa pawp, mi hai kimsut hym ra-ui bongpa rau, nokai rui mih sasi bongpa jyng, yn hai kanu kapa hym ty tamu hym mih kla,’ pei mih rata klysai si hym yn tuk tok bei,” peipa jok mina.<verse eid="MRK 10:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 10:20" />Mi imi hmat, “Sara jyi, mi rata kly byrbyr si hym cy ang raca hka hai kaso keng hpyk hai ky,” pei htim jok mina.<verse eid="MRK 10:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 10:21" />Isu cy mi hym hkrei mih ra-ui hly jau ny, “Yn hkam hia mih ve hlyk hin. Kai ny yn hai kimsut ve mih hnget hym sum mihka imi manga si hkam ret jok; pei py kacy lamuk nam mih kimsut yn man hym hmang; mikum ra ny kajun ang kung,” peipa jok mina. <verse eid="MRK 10:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 10:22" />Pei kapo mi cy cong nʼka malai xr miluk ny, tuk y-mi kly hym kacy mikna murum ny, ra-ui nohnai mihly hmang kaivit mina.<verse eid="MRK 10:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 10:23" />Hnakacy Isu cy hmat hai tabei si hym kanum jau prek ny, “Cong nʼka malai mih si cy kanup Tamuk hai Pyng mira hym mih hkri-par rai hnak!” peipa jok mina.<verse eid="MRK 10:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 10:24" />Tabei si cy tuk hmat hai txr mih kly hym mihka hkri-par lx va mina. Hnakacy Isu hmat, “Raca si jyi, kanup Tamuk hai Pyng mira hym mih cy hkri-par rai prai! <verse eid="MRK 10:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 10:25" />Imi balai kanup Tamuk hai pre hym miluk, kula-uk kahreng nʼkap taram plut mih cy hjon hkryk,” peipa jok mina.<verse eid="MRK 10:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 10:26" />Tabei si cy hkri-par lx va rat ny, “Pei kacy miva hkym man kaklangra htai hym va?” pei mih hmatva tingtawi kahlx karam va mina.<verse eid="MRK 10:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 10:27" />Pei mihka Isu cy misi hym jau hxrcxm ny, “Mi cy Tamuk hmat nona kacy imi hmat nohai py htai lyng; pei kapo Tamuk hkam cy na conghkang si hym py htai,” peipa jok mina.<verse eid="MRK 10:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 10:28" />Hnakacy Petara hmat, “Jau rih, i cy nana byrbyr si hym hjy ty klak ny, kajun yn kung ky,” peipa jok mina.<verse eid="MRK 10:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 10:29" />Isu hmat, “Ang txr ynni rui hkyp hym, mimi po ang hai kahmu luk satang hnai kahmu bah, kim vit, kanu kapa katai kahnau, cei, tahi tahnau hak kimsut hym hjy ty klak mih imi cy, <verse eid="MRK 10:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 10:30" />hmatca hring mih htxm hka tongnang mira hly hpy sum mih kamran kim, vit, kanu kapa, katai kahnau, cei, tahi tahnau si hym man mikum kung mih ning hka, dungjan hringvek po man hym mina. <verse eid="MRK 10:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 10:31" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10.31 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 5:32">Mah 5.32</ref>; <ref loc="1CO 7:10">1 Kor 7.10</ref>,<ref loc="1CO 7:11">11</ref></char></note>Pei kapo ve ri mih imi si cy ve kungbxng hym; ve kungbxng mih imi si cy, ve ri htang hym,” peipa jok mina.<verse eid="MRK 10:31" /></para>
  <para style="s">Isu hmat Htyk hym Mih Satang Txr Hrum Mi-rx Mih</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 20:17-19">Mahtai 20.17–19</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 18:31-34">Luka 18.31–34</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 10:32" />Hnakacy Isu cy hmat hai tabei si hly cyng kai va pin Jerusalem mary htang ny, hmat cy hmang kai tabei si hai ri htang vit mina. Pei mihka tabei si cy katyr va ny, kajun mih imi si po katyr kram va mina. Isu cy pet hpau tabei prelai jua si hym ny, hmathmat hkam katym hym mih sai si txr jok mina. <verse eid="MRK 10:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 10:33" />Hmat cy, “Keng va, i cy cyng kai Jerusalem mary htang pin hym ny, mi mary tum Imi hai Tahi cy pahtyp tun lu si hak tuk Rata mih sara si hai rut luk kahnap hym. Misi cy Imi hai Tahi hym pahtyk hym mih Jenta ceng si hai rut luk ap hym mina. <verse eid="MRK 10:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 10:34" />Jenta ceng si hmat cy, Imi hai Tahi hym hplat ren mihly htawk jok va kria tui mikum, bawm hta ny pahtyk va hym. Pei kapo hrum ni mihka hmat cy htyk mira hai hring rx tyng hym,” peipa jok mina.<verse eid="MRK 10:34" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jakob mija Johan hai Leng Mih</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 20:20-28">Mahtai 20.20–28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 10:35" />Hnakacy Zebede hai tahi Jakob mija Johan cy kai ja Isu hkam ny, “Sara jyi, aci hai leng mih cy jok nang cx,” peipa ja mina.<verse eid="MRK 10:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 10:36" />Isu hmat, “Ynci hym ang py jok na mih hia hai va?” pei hlx jok mina.<verse eid="MRK 10:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 10:37" />Mija mihmat, “Yn hai hpum-ang hly Pyng mira katym mihka aci hym, yn hai at htang jua, kua htang jua cym hym mih jok nang cx a,” peipa jok mina.<verse eid="MRK 10:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 10:38" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">10.38 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LUK 12:50">Luk 12.50</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Pei kapo Isu hmat, “Ynci hmat leng mih cy ynci hmat notuk ja. Ang hkam hym mih tongnang mira hkap hym ynci hkymhai hkam hym ma? Ang man mih baptisma po ynci hkymhai man hym ma?” peipa jok mina.<verse eid="MRK 10:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 10:39" />Mija mihmat, “Aci hkym hai htung,” peipa jok mina.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 10:39">Isu hmat, “Ynci cy ang hkam hym mih hkap hym hkam ja hym; ang man mih baptisma po man ja hym hmang. <verse eid="MRK 10:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 10:40" />Pei kapo ang hai at htang hak kua htang cym hym mih cy ang nohai jok lyng. Y-mi tum cy Tamuk hmat py ty yp mih si hai kavui htung,” peipa jok mina.<verse eid="MRK 10:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 10:41" />Pei mih satang hym ha jua mih tabei si tuk mihka kacy, Jakob mija Johan hym hrak-kaluk va mina. <verse eid="MRK 10:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 10:42" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10.42,43 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 22:25">Luk 22.25</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 22:26">26</ref></char></note>Hnakacy Isu cy hpau tabei si hym ny, “Ynni tuk mih ateng pyng mih tun lu si cy imi si hym hia mihto pyk va mina. Makye si po imi si hkam tong amik ana hly mina. <verse eid="MRK 10:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 10:43" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10.43,44 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 23:11">Mah 23.11</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:35">Mrk 9.35</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:26">Luk 22.26</ref></char></note>Ynni cy yng mihto bongpa py va; ynni long py kye hia mih imi cy, plau ynni hai cinrx hym. <verse eid="MRK 10:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 10:44" />Ynni long hia lu pyk mih imi cy, plau imi byrbyr si hai malu hym. <verse eid="MRK 10:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MRK 10:45" />Txr kacy, Imi hai Tahi cy cin imi si hym mih kahtxp ra mih nona; ve imi si hai cinrx hym mih hak, hmathmat hai hringvek hym ty ty klak ny imi rahjak jua si hym kaklang hym mih kavui kahtxp ra hai htung,” peipa jok mina.<verse eid="MRK 10:45" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mikmeng Mih Batimei hym Isu Py Hnai Mih</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 20:29-34">Mahtai 20.29–34</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 18:35-43">Luka 18.35–43</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="MRK 10:46" />Hnakacy katym va Jeriko mary ny, Isu cy hmat hai tabei si hly tym imi mahu rahjak jua si cy y-mi mary hai cawn va mina. Pei mihtxm hka, Timai hai tahi Batimei pei mih cong ca ve mih mikmeng jua cy cym ve mʼhma ken mina. <verse eid="MRK 10:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MRK 10:47" />Nazaret Isu katym pei mih satang hym tuk mihka, “Davida hai Tahi Isu! Van ang hym cx!” pei ot mina.<verse eid="MRK 10:47" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="MRK 10:48" />Mi hym nopy sau hym mih imi rahjak jua si hmat pring ngak va mina. Pei kapo mi imi cy, “Davida hai Tahi, van ang hym cx!” pei ot ratrat mina.<verse eid="MRK 10:48" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="MRK 10:49" />Pei mihka Isu cy jyng dyng ny, “Mi imi hym hpau nang,” peipa jok mina.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 10:49">Imi si hmat po y-mi mik meng hym hpau ny, “Hra bongpa di! Rx hai, hmat cy hpau yn hym ky,” peipa jok va mina.<verse eid="MRK 10:49" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="MRK 10:50" />Pei mihka mi cy hmat hai hkuk-xk hym hklxt var ty klak ny, kapxt pjung ra Isu hkam mina.<verse eid="MRK 10:50" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="MRK 10:51" />Isu hmat, “Yn hym ang py jok na mih hia hai va?” peipa jok mina.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 10:51">Mikmeng mihmat cy, “Sara jyi, ang cy mik au tyng hym mih hia,” peipa jok mina.<verse eid="MRK 10:51" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="MRK 10:52" />Isu hmat mi imi hkam, “Kai hai, yn hai ybra hmat kahlawi jok yn hym ky,” peipa jok.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 10:52">Mi imi cy mik au prawt ryp ny, kajun kai Isu kung mina.<verse eid="MRK 10:52" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="MRK 11" />
  <para style="s">Awng mihly Kanup Jerusalem Mary ko Mih</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:1-11">Mahtai 21.1–11</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 19:28-40">Luka 19.28–40</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 12:12-19">Johan 12.12–19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 11:1" />Hnakacy Isu hak tabei si cy katym Jerusalem mary ken mihka, katym va Bethpaki nam hak Behtani nam ken mih Olivi hrxng nxi mina. <verse eid="MRK 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 11:2" />Pei mihka hmat hai tabei pre jua hkam, “Kai ja Ynci hai nga htang ve mih nam tum ny, kanup nam ko mihka mimi po nokatang vai mih kingo le hlyk katan ve leng hly mih ynci kakrum hym hmang. Y-mi leng hym hklam ny hawi nang ja ang hkam. <verse eid="MRK 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 11:3" />Imi juajua hmat ynci hkam, ‘Napei mih ynci hklam kingo leng let va?’ Pei hlx kacy Malai<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11.3 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Malai; </char><char style="ft" closed="false">nona kacy</char><char style="fqa" closed="false">tunjua.</char></note> hmat hia aly peh, hra nang prawt tyng hym htung, pei txr jok a,” peipa jok mina.<verse eid="MRK 11:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 11:4" />Hnakacy mija cy kai ny, mʼhma ken ve mih kim hlyk hai mʼplot ken leng hly katan ve mih kingo le hym kakrum ja kacy leng hym hklam ja mina. <verse eid="MRK 11:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 11:5" />Mʼhma tum jyng ve mih kawt mih imi si hmat, “Ynci cy napei mih hklam kingo leng let va?” pei hlx va mina.<verse eid="MRK 11:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 11:6" />Mija cy Isu hmat jx ty mih ateng txr jok mihka, misi hmat po kingo leng hym jok hklam mina. <verse eid="MRK 11:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 11:7" />Mija cy kingo le hym hawi nang ja Isu hkam ny, kingo le nxi bai jok hmatja hai hkuk-xk si mihka katang jok Isu hym mina. <verse eid="MRK 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 11:8" />Pei mihka imi rahjak jua si cy mʼhma nxi bai jok hmatva hai long-van si hym mina. Kawt mih imi si cy bet htang hai tu sxn nang hring ram hpok si mihka bai jok va mina. <verse eid="MRK 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 11:9" />Hmat hai nga htang po, kung htang po, kajun mih imi si hmat cy, “Hosana! Tamuk hai ming hly kahtxp ra mih Malai cy rau hnai nahky! <verse eid="MRK 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 11:10" />Katym ra hym mih i hai kapa! Sangmrang Davida hai pre cy rau hnai nahky! Hrau kyk mih Tamuk hym cy Hosana pei mihly pahlo va nahky!” pei ot va mina.<verse eid="MRK 11:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 11:11" />Hnakacy Isu cy katym Jerusalem mary mihka, kanup Kacukim ko ny nana si hym kaving jau prek mina. Hnakacy rasa iu van ky pei mihka tabei prelai jua si hly tym cawn kai va Behtani nam htang mina.<verse eid="MRK 11:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ui noui Mih Lut hring</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:18-19">Mahtai 21.18–19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 11:12" />Hna mih ni hka, Behtani nam htang hai hlawi ra tyng va mihka Isu cy hrakbxt mina. <verse eid="MRK 11:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 11:13" />Pei mihka ram bawm ve na mih lut hring hym hla htang hai hly ki ny, ui ve let bah pei mihly kai hring tut mina. Katym hring tut mihka kacy lut ui mih ning nona hin miluk ny kakrum ram klai mina. <verse eid="MRK 11:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 11:14" />Pei mihka Isu hmat lut hring hym, “Mimi po hmatca hai kaso dungpxn, yn hai ui hym ynghak hka po noman cak nahky!” pei bak mina.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 11:14">Pei txr mih kly cy hmat hai tabei si po tuk ria mina.<verse eid="MRK 11:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Isu Kai Kacukim Mih</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:12-17">Mahtai 21.12–17</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 19:45-48">Luka 19.45–48</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 2:13-22">Johan 2.13–22</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 11:15" />Hnakacy misi cy katym va Jerusalem mary mihka, Isu cy kanup Kacukim ko ny, Kacukim ko py kasum kapai mih imi si byrbyr hym hnang prxk mina. Kaklang pasa nʼka mih imi si hai hkung si hak sum bahu mih si hai cym hkung si hym po hnawt kai pxn mina. <verse eid="MRK 11:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 11:16" />Mimi hym po Kacukim ko sum ran hym mihak nana vonsai si sxn nang hym mih paka mina. <verse eid="MRK 11:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 11:17" />Hmat cy misi hkam, “Ang hai Kacukim cy imi ceng byrbyr si hai kavui pycuk mih kim pei hpau va hym, pei mih Baibu ko kei ty mih nona ma? Pei kapo mi kim hym ynni cy plau jok laku damra si ka-ung mih hpuk let be!” pei ngak jok mina.<verse eid="MRK 11:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 11:18" />Hmathmat pei txr mih kly hym pahtyp tun lu si hak tuk Rata mih sara si tuk va kacy, pahtyk Isu hym mih mʼhma hau va mina. Txr kacy, hmat hai txr riu mih sai hym imi mahu si cy hkri-par lx va hnak miluk, misi cy hmat hym kram va mina.<verse eid="MRK 11:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 11:19" />Hnakacy rasa nge mihka jak htang Isu hak hmat hai tabei si cy mary hai cawn kai va mina.<verse eid="MRK 11:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Lut Hring hkam hai Kariu Mira</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:20-22">Mahtai 21.20–22</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 11:20" />Hna jang ni ngxr htang hmxrkling mih ning hka, hmat hak tabei si cy kaving va mʼhma hput mihka ki va lut hring hym mina. Mi hring cy hing si hai kaso hring dyk raw verawn hnak mina. <verse eid="MRK 11:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 11:21" />Pei mihka Petara cy man sadi vau ny Isu hkam, “Malai, jau rih, yn hai jok deng mih lut hring cy raw verawn hnak vit ky,” peipa jok mina.<verse eid="MRK 11:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 11:22" />Isu hmat misi hkam, “Yb va Tamuk hym, <verse eid="MRK 11:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 11:23" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11.23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 17:20">Mah 17.20</ref>; <ref loc="1CO 13:2">1 Kor 13.2</ref></char></note>Ang txr ynni hkyp hym mimi po ra-ui nohymle mihly txr mih ateng man hym pei mih yb mih si cy mi hrxng hym kahrxt kai vit, kavyng kai panglei ko pei txr kacy mimi txr mih ateng na hkyp hym. <verse eid="MRK 11:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 11:24" />Hnakacy ang txr ynni hym pycuk mihka ynni leng mih si cy man hkyp hym, pei mih ynni yb kacy leng mih si hnget cy ynni man hkyp hym mina. <verse eid="MRK 11:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 11:25" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11.25,26 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 6:14">Mah 6.14</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 6:15">15</ref></char></note>Ynni cy jyng mihly pycuk mihka, ynni hym mi hmat py tahmang mih kamngo si ve kacy pahlawi jok mikla. Pei kacy lamuk nam htang ve mih ynni hai Kapa hmat po, ynni py tahmang mih kamngo si hym pahlawi tyng hym.” <verse eid="MRK 11:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" pubnumber="[26]" sid="MRK 11:26" /><note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11.26 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Kawt mih kei ty rut hly mih ca-uk si luk cy cem 26: </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Ynni cy mi hai kamngo hym no van kacy, lamuk htang ve mih ynni hai kapa hmat po ynni hai kamngo hym van hym mih nona, peipa jok mina, </char><char style="ft" closed="false">pei mih ve (jau </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="MAT 6:15">Mah 6.15</ref></char>).</note><verse eid="MRK 11:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">Isu hai Pyhtai ra hym Hlx Mih</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:23-27">Mahtai 21.23–27</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:1-8">Luka 20.1–8</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 11:27" />Hnakacy Isu hak tabei si cy katym va Jerusalem mary bei mina. Isu cy kanup kai Kacukim ko ny, pahtyp tun lu si, tuk Rata mih sara si hak py lu mih katang si po katym ra hmathmat hkam ny, <verse eid="MRK 11:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 11:28" />misi hmat, “Yn hai py nana mih si cy miva hai amik ana hly py hai va? Miva hmat jok yn hym amik ana hai va?” txr nang peipa va mina.<verse eid="MRK 11:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 11:29" />Isu hmat misi hkam, “Ynni hym ang hlx hlyk hym hin; ang hai hlx mih kly ynni htim nang mihka, ang py mih nana si po miva hai amik ana hly py hai bah, pei mih ang txr ynni hym. <verse eid="MRK 11:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 11:30" />Johan hai py mih baptisma cy lamuk htang hai ma, nona kacy imi hkam hai ma? txr nang vah!” peipa jok mina.<verse eid="MRK 11:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 11:31" />Misi cy karam va ny, “I napei txr hym va? ‘Lamuk htang hai’ i pei txr kacy, napei mih ‘Johan hym ynni noyb let be?’ pei bei hym; <verse eid="MRK 11:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 11:32" />pei kapo, ‘Imi hkam hai,’ pei txr jok kacy,” imi byrbyr si cy Johan hym ahmo na, pei yb va miluk ny, misi cy kram va imi mahu si hym bei. <verse eid="MRK 11:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 11:33" />Pei miluk misi hmat Isu hkam, “I notuk yng,” pei htim jok mina.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 11:33">Hnakacy Isu hmat, “Yng mihto ang po miva hai amik ana hly py nana si, pei mih ang notxr ynni hym lyng,” peipa jok mina.<verse eid="MRK 11:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="MRK 12" />
  <para style="s">Hlai Krip Rakua Mih Jua hly Kanyk jok Mih</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:33-46">Mahtai 21.33–46</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:9-19">Luka 20.9–19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 12:1" />Isu cy misi hkam betbet mih kanyk kly hly kahang txr jok mih cy “Imi jua cy py ty krip rakua mina. Hne krip tui hym mih tym kom po htai ny, kadyng hym mih tym taluk po py ty mina. Hnakacy mi bai hym hrung hly hlai jok mihka hmat cy cawn kai pin bet pre htang vit mina. <verse eid="MRK 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 12:2" />Hna ui mih ning katym kacy hmat cy cinrx jua hym, hrua jok krip rakua hlai mih imi si hkam ny, hmat hai man hym mih hpy po leng jok mina. <verse eid="MRK 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 12:3" />Rakua hlai mih imi si hmat cy, mi cinrx hym hnap ny bawm hta mikum kut hrua kai cakset hmat klai mina. <verse eid="MRK 12:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 12:4" />Rakua jua cy bet mih cinrx jua mih hym hrua bei mina. Rakua hlai mih imi si hmat mi cinrx hai lu hym bawm hta ny, jok hrak-pruk mihly hrua kai va mina. <verse eid="MRK 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 12:5" />Bet mih cinrx jua hym hrua tynglyng bei kapo, rakua hlai mih imi si cy mi hym pahtyk pai vit mina. <verse eid="MRK 12:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 12:6" />Rakua jua cy hmat hkrei mih tahi ve jua lei ngai ky. Hnakacy mi cy, ‘Ang hai tahi hym cy ty va tamu hym htung’ pei mih ra-ui hly, hrua hmat hai tahi hym mina. <verse eid="MRK 12:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 12:7" />Pei kapo rakua hlai mih misi hmat, ‘mi cy rakua jua hai kimsut kamtym mih mi na. Ra va, mi hym pahtyk i va mo; pei mihka neni krip rakua hym cy i kamtym hym!’ pei mih hmatva tingtawi karam va mina. <verse eid="MRK 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 12:8" />Hnakacy krip rakua jua hai tahi hym hnap cai va mihka bawm hta va ny, rakua kum htang var ty klak va mina.<verse eid="MRK 12:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 12:9" />“Pei mihka rakua jua cy hkym pyk na hym va? Hmat cy ra ny, rakua hlai mih imi si hym pahtyk pai king mikum, krip rakua cy bet mih imi si hkam ap jok vit hym. <verse eid="MRK 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 12:10" />Baibu hai kly sai cy:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 12:10">“ ‘Ai kim mih si hai nohia mih hua cy,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MRK 12:10">plau kai aly kye kyk mih cun tum mih hua let mina. <verse eid="MRK 12:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 12:11" />Mi cy Malai hai py mih si na ny,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MRK 12:11">ihai mik tut plau ringrang si mina’ pei mih ynni nohprai vai misai ma?” peipa jok mina.<verse eid="MRK 12:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 12:12" />Juda ceng py lu mih si cy, mi kanyk kly cy txr hmatva hym hai ky pei ny, hnap Isu hym mih patym hau va mina. Pei kapo kram va imi mahu si hym miluk ny, hmathmat hkam hai cawn kai va pxn mina.<verse eid="MRK 12:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jok Kahmu Mih sai hym Hlx Mih</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 22:15-22">Mahtai 22.15–22</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:20-26">Luka 20.20–26</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 12:13" />Mikum misi cy Hparisai si hak kawt mih Heroda hai imi si hym hrua va Isu hkam mina. <verse eid="MRK 12:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 12:14" />Misi cy hmat hkam, “Sara, yn cy txr rui hkyp mina. Imi hai mikna hym nojau mihmat, Tamuk hai klysai hym txr riu nang rui hkyp pei mih i tuk ky. I cy Hkaisara sangmrang hkam jok kahmu mih cy Rata hly kamlau ma? Nokamlau ma?” pei hlx va mina.<verse eid="MRK 12:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 12:15" />Pei kapo Isu cy misi hai hkla hlx mih kamhi hym tuk jau vit miluk ny, “Ynni cy napei mih cam ang hym ryry let va? Nang denarih pasa klap lym rih ang jau hym hin,” peipa jok mina.<verse eid="MRK 12:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 12:16" />Misi hmat jokjok ny hmathmat cy misi hkam, “Cami apung hak cami ming cy miva hai apung, miva hai ming va?” pei hlx jok mina.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 12:16">Misi hmat, “Hkaisara hai pung hak Hkaisara hai ming na,” pei htim jok mina.<verse eid="MRK 12:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 12:17" />Hnakacy Isu hmat misi hkam, “Hkaisara pyng mih von cy jok va Hkaisara hkam ny, Tamuk hai pyng mih von cy jok va Tamuk hkam,” peipa jok ny.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 12:17">Hnakacy misi cy Isu hym lx va mina.<verse eid="MRK 12:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Htyk Mira hai Rx tyng Mih Satang hym Kahlx Mih</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 22:23-33">Mahtai 22.23–33</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:27-40">Luka 20.27–40</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 12:18" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">12.18 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ACT 23:8">Rah 23.8</ref>
      </char>
    </note> Htyk mira long hai rx tyng mih cy nove, pei ny kawt mih Sadukai si cy kai Isu hkam ny, <verse eid="MRK 12:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 12:19" />“Sara jyi, ‘imi jua cy tahi tahnau nove mihmat htyk kaivit kacy mi hai juhrau hym kahnau paw ny, krung jok katai hai hprek hym mikla,’ pei mih Mosi hmat jok ty rata kly mih ve. <verse eid="MRK 12:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 12:20" />Hnakacy katai kahnau ve ranit jua hym ky; katai salu mih cy py kimsut ny, noman tahi tahnau mihmat htyk kaivit. <verse eid="MRK 12:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 12:21" />Pei mihka jang mih kahnau hmat paw katai hai juhrau hym ryp ny, mi po noman tahi tahnau mihmat htyk kai tynglyng bei mina. Yng mihto tyng hrum mih, lit mih kahnau si po noman tahi tahnau mihmat htyk kai tynglyng bei mina. <verse eid="MRK 12:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 12:22" />Pei mihly hmat katai kahnau ranit jua si cy noman tahi mihmat htyk kai va pxn mina. <verse eid="MRK 12:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 12:23" />Katai kahnau ranit jua si cy mi kacai hai hua na byrbyr va miluk ny, htyk mira long hai rx tyng mih ni hka mi kacai cy hkym plau miva hai ju hym va?” pei hlx va mina.<verse eid="MRK 12:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 12:24" />Isu hmat misi hkam, “Ynni cy Baibu hym po notuk, Tamuk hai hpum tako hym po notuk miluk ynni cy tahmang mʼhma mina. <verse eid="MRK 12:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 12:25" />Imi si cy htyk mira long hai rx tyng mihka kacy, kapaw mih po nove, ve lamuk nam mih angel si hto kayng hym mina. <verse eid="MRK 12:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 12:26" />Htyk misi hai rx tyng mih satang hym kei ty mih Mosi hai ca-uk hym ynni nohprai vai misai ma? Y-mi ca-uk luk cy bing hlom hai hmailxn cawn mih satang tum Tamuk hmat, ‘Ang cy Abraham hai Tamuk, Isaka hai Tamuk, Jakob hai Tmuk na’ pei mih Mosi hkam txr jok mina. <verse eid="MRK 12:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 12:27" />Hmat cy htyk mih si hai Tamuk nona, hring mih imi si hai Tamuk na. Ynni hai kadawn cy hkri-par tahmang kaivit ky!” peipa jok mina.<verse eid="MRK 12:27" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kye Mih Rata Kly</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 22:34-40">Mahtai 22.34–40</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 10:25-28">Luka 10.25–28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 12:28" />Isu cy Sadukai si hly pei ka-ek kaklau va kly hput mihka tuk Rata mih sara jua cy keng ny, Isu hmat misi hkam txr jok hnaipxng mih cy tuk miluk, kai hmat hkam mihka, “Rata kly byrbyr long yngham mih rata klysai cy kye kyk hym va?” pei hlx mina.<verse eid="MRK 12:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 12:29" />Isu hmat, “Oh! Isarel ceng si, keng va! ‘I hai Malai Tamuk dungjan Tamuk cy hlyk ngai mih dungjan Tamuk na.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12.29 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">I hai Malai Tamuk dungjan Tamuk cy hlyk ngai mih dungjan Tamuk na; </char><char style="ft" closed="false">nona kacy </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Tamuk cy ve jua le ngai mih Malai na.</char></note> <verse eid="MRK 12:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 12:30" />Ynni hai Malai Tamuk hym cy yn hai ra-ui, yn hai limla, yn hai cing mih si byrbyr hak, yn hai hra byrbyr hly hkrei hym mikla,’ pei mih cy cxk-ri hai kye kyk mih rata kly na. <verse eid="MRK 12:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 12:31" />Jang hai kye kyk mih rata kly cy cami na: ‘Yn hmat hym hkrei mihto, yn hmat hai nʼrum si hym po hkrei mikla.’ Cami rata kly pre sai luk bet kye kyk mih rata kly nove lyng ky,” peipa jok mina.<verse eid="MRK 12:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 12:32" />Tuk Rata mih sara si hmat Isu hkam, “Sara jyi! Yn hai kly cy rui hkyp, Malai Tamuk cy hlyk ngai mina. Bet Tamuk nove bei lyng ky. <verse eid="MRK 12:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 12:33" />Tamuk hym cy ra-ui hak cak, cing mira byrbyr hak, hra byrbyr hly hkrei mikla. Yn hmat hym hkrei mihto nʼrum si hym po hkrei hym mikla; pei mih rata kly pre sai hym parui mih cy, Tamuk hkam pahtyp mih tawn-ngeng byrbyr si luk po hnai kyk,” peipa jok mina.<verse eid="MRK 12:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 12:34" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">12.28–34 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LUK 10:25-28">Luk 10.25–28</ref>
      </char>
    </note> Mi hai cing mira hly htim mih sai Isu cy tuk ny mi imi hkam, “Yn cy Tamuk hai Pyng mira hak nohla lyng ky,” peipa jok mina.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 12:34">Pei mikum kacy Isu hkam mimi po nohai vam hlx va bei ky.<verse eid="MRK 12:34" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kahlx Messiah hai Satang Mih</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 22:41-46">Mahtai 22.41–46</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:41-44">Luka 20.41–44</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 12:35" />Isu cy Kacukim ko txr riu ve hput mihka misi hkam, “Messiah cy Davida hai hprek na, pei mih tuk Rata mih sara si txr mih cy napei hai va? <verse eid="MRK 12:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 12:36" />Limla Syr hai hamho hly Davida txr mih cy:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 12:36">“ ‘Malai hmat ang hai Malai hkam</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MRK 12:36">yn hai hrak-yk si hym yn hai hkawkhpa kly noty miryk cy</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MRK 12:36">cym ang hai at htang, pei mih txr jok ky,’ peipa jok mina.<verse eid="MRK 12:36" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 12:37" />Davida hmat Hkrista hym ‘Malai,’ pei hpau kacy, napei mih Hkrista cy na Davida hai tahi let hym pei ma?” peipa jok mina.</para>
  <para style="s" vid="MRK 12:37">Isu hmat Tuk Rata mih Sara si hym Karia jok Mih</para>
  <para style="r" vid="MRK 12:37">(<ref loc="MAT 23:1-36">Mahtai 23.1–36</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:45-47">Luka 20.45–47</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 12:37">Nene nona mih imi mahu si cy Isu hai klysai hym hrakpau mihly keng va mina. <verse eid="MRK 12:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 12:38" />Pei txr riu ve hput mihka hmathmat cy, “Tuk Rata mih sara si hym kria va, misi cy kahlong lungki hur si mihka kaving pua longlang hym mih hia va; ci tum, seng si tum kaving mihka imi si hmat ty tamu ny kalum hym mih hia va mina. <verse eid="MRK 12:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 12:39" />Kacukim si tum pet ty ty mih cym tym si hak, pawi si tum po cym tym hnai kyk mih si hia va mina. <verse eid="MRK 12:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 12:40" />Misi cy klyngmai kacai hai kim hym hia man miluk ny, imi si keng hnai mipar pycuk klang hnak mina. Misi cy lik kyk mih aprek cet tara mih kakrum va hym,” peipa jok mina.<verse eid="MRK 12:40" /></para>
  <para style="s">Klyngmai Kacai hai Kajok Mih</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 21:1-4">Luka 21.1–4</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 12:41" />Isu cy Kacukim hai ty ahlu mih hkap ken cym ny, imi si hai ty ahlu mih si hym jau mina. Imi malai si cy ty ahlu nʼka rahjak hnak mina. <verse eid="MRK 12:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 12:42" />Manga mih klyngmai kacai jua cy ra ny, kapria pasa pre klap hym ty ahlu kit ria mina. <verse eid="MRK 12:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 12:43" />Pei mihka Isu cy hpau hmat hai tabei si hym ny misi hkam, “Ang txr ynni hkyp hym; ty ahlu mih imi byrbyr si luk po, mi manga mih klyngmai kacai hai ty mih ahlu cy hu kyk. <verse eid="MRK 12:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 12:44" />Mi imi si cy, hmatva hai malai mih kimsut long hai kamlau miryk jok hai htung. Pei kapo cami klyngmai kacai cy manga tok kapo hmat hai ve kangdek lei mih hym jok pai kit ky,” peipa jok mina.<verse eid="MRK 12:44" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="MRK 13" />
  <para style="s">Kacukim Kahnawi hym mih Satang Isu Txr Mih</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:1-2">Mahtai 24.1–2</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:5-6">Luka 21.5–6</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 13:1" />Isu cy Kacukim hai cawn mihka, hmat hai tabei si long mih jua mih cy hmat hkam, “Sara jyi, jau rih! Mi huapu si hak, mi kim-ma si cy, hkri-par kye hnak be!” peipa mina.<verse eid="MRK 13:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 13:2" />Isu hmat misi hkam, “Mi kye mih kim-ma si hym yn ki htung nona ma? Mi kim-ma si hai hua hym cy pahnawi kai pxn hym ny; hua hlyk luk hlyk klynglyng mih hlyk po ve hym mih nona,” peipa jok mina.<verse eid="MRK 13:2" /></para>
  <para style="s">Rai Mira hak Nang Mira si</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:3-14">Mahtai 24.3–14</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:7-19">Luka 21.7–19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 13:3" />Isu cy cym ve Olivi hrxng nxi ny kahjua ve Kacukim htang mihka Petara, Jakob, Johan hak Andria si cy kai hmat hkam ny, <verse eid="MRK 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 13:4" />“Yn hai txr nang mih byrbyr si cy katym ynghak hka hym va? Y-mi nana si byrbyr kangxm hym mih ning hka cy na kahmar-ra si katxng hym va? Txr nang i hym cx,” pei hlx va mina.<verse eid="MRK 13:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 13:5" />Isu hmat misi hkam, “Ynni hym mihmat nopawp hym mih ve va tau hly a, <verse eid="MRK 13:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 13:6" />Imi rahjak jua si cy kakar ang hai ming mihly katym ra hym ny, ‘Ang cy mi ky cah!’ pei txr mihly imi rahjak jua si hym pawp hym mina. <verse eid="MRK 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 13:7" />Ynni cy katu he hym mih satang hak katu he mih satang si tuk mihka, bongpa kamawn hyng vehtun va. Pei mih nana si cy katym ngui hym mina. Pei kapo txt bxng mih ning cy nona hin. <verse eid="MRK 13:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 13:8" />Imi ceng hlyk hak ceng hlyk katu he hym ny, pre hlyk hak pre hlyk po katu he hym. Kxp tymkor tum po ciu hyng hym ny, hkam cak purkang si katym hym. Pei mih nana si cy katym ra mih cy cxk-ri mih nangkre si na.<verse eid="MRK 13:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 13:9" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">13.9–11 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 10:17-20">Mah 10.17–20</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 12:11">Luk 12.11</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 12:12">12</ref></char>
    </note>“Ynni cy ve va tau hly; kawt mih imi si cy hnap ynni hym ny, hra ynni tara jung hym. Kacukim si tum po bawm hta ynni hym. Ynni cy ang hai klyn makye si hak sangmrang si nga jyng ny, misi hkam plau jok ang hai sasi si hym. <verse eid="MRK 13:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 13:10" />Pei kapo ynni cy bonpre notxt hin mihka, imi ceng conghkang byrbyr si hkam kahtyi jok Satang Hnai va a. <verse eid="MRK 13:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 13:11" />Imi si cy hnap ynni hym ny hra tara jung mihka napei txr hym bah, pei mih ra-ui bongpa kamawn va. Pei mih ning hka ynni hmat ra-ui hai cawn ra mih klysai hly pai txr va. Mi klysai si cy ynni hai txr mih nona, Limla Syr hmat tahpong hai htung. <verse eid="MRK 13:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 13:12" />Imi si cy katai kahnau tingtawi pahtyk hym mih hnap jok hym ny, kapa si cy hmatva hai tahi tahnau si hym po pahtyk hym mih hnap jok hym mina. Tahi si po kanu kapa si hym hau kangak ny pahtyk hym mih hnap jok hym. <verse eid="MRK 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 13:13" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13.13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 10:22">Mah 10.22</ref></char></note>Ang hai hpu luk ynni hym imi si hmat nohia jau hym. Pei kapo ang hai ming hly txtkrym par hkawt mih imi cy man kaklangra hym mina.<verse eid="MRK 13:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Sxr Kram Hnai Mih si</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:15-28">Mahtai 24.15–28</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:20-24">Luka 21.20–24</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 13:14" />“ ‘Sxr kram hym hnai mih’ rai mira si cy, nove sang mih tym tum ve let mih cy ynni ki mihka hprai mih si hnget cy tuk keng nahky!” Pei ki mihka kacy Juda pre ve mih imi si cy pjung va hrxng htang nahky. <verse eid="MRK 13:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 13:15" />Ve kim nxi mih imi cy bawngpa kahtxp kim ko nana si pawk nahky. <verse eid="MRK 13:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 13:16" />Ve lei mih imi po, paw hmat hai hkuk-xk hym mih bongpa kut kai kim nahky. <verse eid="MRK 13:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 13:17" />Y-mi ning ni hka cy raca ve mupum mih kacai hak, raca loi hkam jon mih kanu si cy hkri-par nang mira kakrum hym! <verse eid="MRK 13:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 13:18" />Pei mih ning ni cy nokapyk cungrau hym mih pycuk va a! <verse eid="MRK 13:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 13:19" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13.19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 7:14">Kat 7.14</ref></char></note>Y-mi ni cy hkri-par rai mira nangkre katym mih ni na. Yng mihto katym jok mih cy Tamuk hmat palum bon hkyp hai kaso hmatca hkrai po nove vai hin; nga htang po ve bei hym mih nona. <verse eid="MRK 13:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 13:20" />Y-mi ning ni hym cy Malai hmat nolui jok kacy, mimi po y-mi rai mira long hai kahlawi hym mih nona. Pei kapo hmat hai ryi ty mih imi si hai kavui y-mi ning ni cy lui jok hym.<verse eid="MRK 13:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 13:21" />“Y-mi ning hka cy imi juajua hmat ynni hkam, ‘Jau rih, Messiah cy ve cami tum ca! Ve y-mi tum yh!’ Pei txr tok kapo, bongpa yb va. <verse eid="MRK 13:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 13:22" />Txr kacy, Kakar Messiah mih si hak, kakar ahmo mih si cawn ra hym. Misi hmat py htai let pane cy Tamuk hmat ryi ty mih imi si hym pawp hym mih, lx hnai mih nana si hly ringrang mih kahmar-ra si po txng nang va hym. <verse eid="MRK 13:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 13:23" />Ynni cy ve va tau hly! Pei mih nana byrbyr si nokatym mihmat, ynni hkam ang kakram txr ty yp hai ky, peipa jok mina.<verse eid="MRK 13:23" /></para>
  <para style="s">Imi hai Tahi Kahtxp ra Bei hym Mih</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:29-31">Mahtai 24.29–31</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:25-28">Luka 21.25–28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 13:24" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">13.24 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="REV 6:12">Kat 6.12</ref>
      </char>
    </note>“Pei tongnang mih nangkre si katym mikum kacy, rasa cy mu hym ny, lila po nyi hym mih nona, <verse eid="MRK 13:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 13:25" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13.25 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 6:13">Kat 6.13</ref></char></note> karet si po lamuk htang hai kavyng ra hym; lamuk htang hai hpum tako si po kahyng hym. <verse eid="MRK 13:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 13:26" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13.26 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 1:7">Kat 1.7</ref></char></note>Pei mihka, Imi hai Tahi cy hpum-ang kye prai mihak malai mira hly nua nxi hai kahtxp ra mih cy imi si ki va hym. <verse eid="MRK 13:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 13:27" />Imi hai Tahi cy hmathmat hai angel si hym, bonpre krongtom hai kaso lamuk bon txt mipar hrua krongtom cun liu htang ny, hmathmat hai pet ryi ty mih imi si hym pangxm hym mina.<verse eid="MRK 13:27" /></para>
  <para style="s">Lut Hring hai Kariu Mira</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:32-35">Mahtai 24.32–35</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:29-33">Luka 21.29–33</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 13:28" />“Lut hring hai ve mih sai hym kanyk va; lut hring cy mei cawn ny ram sek hpawk kacy, tokpreng katym hym ky, pei mih cy ynni tuk mina. <verse eid="MRK 13:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 13:29" />Yng mihto tyng ynni po, y-mi nana si katym mih ki kacy, Imi hai Tahi cy kahtxp ra hym mih ning cy hket ky ny, jyng ve mʼplot ken ky,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">13.29 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">ning cy hket ky ny, jyng ve mʼplot ken ky; </char><char style="ft" closed="false">nona kacy </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">hmat kahtxp ra hym mih ning cy hket ky.</char></note> pei mih hkin ty va. <verse eid="MRK 13:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 13:30" />Ang txr ynni rui hkyp hym, mi nana byrbyr si cy hmatca hring ve mih imi si nohtyk hin mihka hmat kangxm hym mina. <verse eid="MRK 13:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 13:31" />Lamuk hak bon kahma kapo, ang hai klysai cy ynghak hka po nokahma lyng.<verse eid="MRK 13:31" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ning Ni cy Mimi po Notuk</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:36-44">Mahtai 24.36–44</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 13:32" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">13.32 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 24:36">Mah 24.36</ref>
      </char>
    </note>“Pei kapo y-mi nana si katym hym mih ning hak ni cy, Pa hmat nona kacy mimi po notuk; lamuk nam mih angel si po notuk, Tahi po notuk lyng. <verse eid="MRK 13:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 13:33" />Y-mi ning ni cy katym ynghak hym bah, pei mih ynni notuk miluk ve tau hly ny; pycuk mihly ming ve yp vah. <verse eid="MRK 13:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 13:34" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13.34 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 12:36-38">Luk 12.36–38</ref></char></note> Imi jua cy hla prai mih pre tum kai pin hym mihka, hmat hai kim hym ap ty cinrx si hkam ny, misi hym jokjok tok kxkx mina. Mʼplot typ mih jua hym po, typ hnaipxng hym mih jok ty kly hkik mihto, <verse eid="MRK 13:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 13:35" />ynni cy kim jua katym ra hym mih ning notuk miluk ny, ming ve yp va a. Kim jua cy jak htang bah, karlong hka bah, karka hek bah, ngxr hmxrkling hka bah pei mih ynni notuk lyng. <verse eid="MRK 13:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 13:36" />Kim jua cy hmatca katym ra tamangtang let mihka, ynni mxi pai ngym mih kakrum let tam. <verse eid="MRK 13:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 13:37" />Pei miluk ynni hym ang jok sadi mihto cy, imi byrbyr si hym ang jok sadi mina. Ve va tau hly ny, ming va yp a!” peipa jok mina.<verse eid="MRK 13:37" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="MRK 14" />
  <para style="s">Isu hym Patym Pahtyk Mih</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:1-5">Mahtai 26.1–5</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:1">Luka 22.1</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 22:2">2</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 11:45-53">Johan 11.45–53</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 14:1" />Pxtkan mih Pawi hak bur nokabua mih kawm dam Pawi katym hym mih hia pre ni hin mihka, pahtyp tun lu si hak tuk Rata mih sara si cy, hmat hym hnap kai jxn ny pahtyk kai hym mih patym hau va mina. <verse eid="MRK 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 14:2" />Misi hmat, “Imi si hkru nganglang hnak let bah pei mih kamawn va ny, pawi long cy bongpa hnap i rih mo,” pei karam va mina.<verse eid="MRK 14:2" /></para>
  <para style="s">Behtani Nam Isu hym Pahtxm Rimui Mih</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:6-13">Mahtai 26.6–13</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 12:1-8">Johan 12.1–8</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 14:3" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">14.3 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LUK 7:37">Luk 7.37</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 7:38">38</ref></char>
    </note> Behtani nam rangak ve mih Simon pei mih imi hai kim ko Isu cy cym ca ve cak hput mihka, kacai jua cy ra ny, hkri-par hrung kasuk mih sapikanar rimui tui hym sxn nang hua kok hklur bxk ny pahtxm jok Isu hai lu luk mina. <verse eid="MRK 14:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 14:4" />Kawt mih imi si cy hrak-kaluk ny, “Napei mih rimui tui hym pei hponghpat kai txtx let va? <verse eid="MRK 14:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 14:5" />Mi rimui hym sum denarih pasa<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">14.5 </char><char style="fk" closed="false">denarih pasa: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Jau </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="MRK 6:37">6.37</ref></char>.</note> hrum sum hly nonai ny, imi manga si hkam jok kacy hnai hkryk hym hin!” pei mih hmatva tingtawi kaklai katxr va ny, mi kacai hym ngak va mina.<verse eid="MRK 14:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 14:6" />Pei kapo Isu hmat, “Mi kacai hym na sai po bongpa pyk va! Mi hym napei mih hkruhkra jok let va? Mi cy ang hkam py hnai hai tok be. <verse eid="MRK 14:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 14:7" />Imi manga si cy ve ynni hly tym joja htung; misi hym ynni hmat hia mihka sawm jok htai mina. Ang neni ynni hly ve tym jo hym mih nona. <verse eid="MRK 14:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 14:8" />Mi kacai cy hmat hai py sang mih ryk py hai htung; ang hai vak hym palum hym mih pahtxm htuk nang rimui yb hai ky. <verse eid="MRK 14:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 14:9" />Ang txr ynni hkyphkyp hym, bonpre dyk txr satang hnai mih teng, mi kacai hym tuk jok hym mih, mi hai py mih sai si hym txr va jojo hym,” peipa jok mina.<verse eid="MRK 14:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Juda Pasym Isu hym Sum Mih</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:14-16">Mahtai 26.14–16</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:3-6">Luka 22.3–6</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 14:10" />Tabei prelai jua si long hai Juda Isakarot cy, Isu hym hrak-yk si hai rut luk ap hym mih kai pahtyp tun lu si hkam mina. <verse eid="MRK 14:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 14:11" />Misi cy mi hai ra mih sai hym tuk va kacy hrakpau va ny, mi hym jok nʼka hym pei kadok jok va mina. Hnakacy Juda cy Isu hym hrak-yk si rut luk ap hym mih patym hau ning hnai mina.<verse eid="MRK 14:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Isu cy Tabei si hly tym Pxtkan mih Pawi Kasua ca Cak Mih</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:17-25">Mahtai 26.17–25</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:7-14">Luka 22.7–14</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 22:21-23">21–23</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 13:21-30">Johan 13.21–30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 14:12" />Bur nokabua mih Komdam Pawi cxk-ri mih ni, Pxtkan mih Pawi kavui pahtyp beram le hak mih pawi ni hka, tabei si cy hmat hkam, “Yn hai kavui Pxtkan mih Pawi jak cak hym i kai ny sawn jok yngham mitum hym va?” pei hlx va mina.<verse eid="MRK 14:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 14:13" />Hnakacy Isu hmat tabei pre jua hkam, “Ynci cy kai ja mary long ny; lawi nang tui ryk mih imi jua hym kakrum hym hmang, kajun kai ja mi kung ny, <verse eid="MRK 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 14:14" />mi kanup mih kim jua hkam, ‘Pxtkan mih pawi tum Sara hmat hak tabei si ca jak cak hym mih ahkai cy yngham mitum va?’ pei mih sara hmat hlx jok hai peipa jok ja a. <verse eid="MRK 14:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 14:15" />Hnakacy hmathmat cy nxi mih ahkai kau prai mitum py ty mih tym tum txng nang hym hmang. Y-mi tum cy i hai kavui sawn ty yp a,” peipa jok mina.<verse eid="MRK 14:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 14:16" />Tabei pre jua mija cy kai ja ny, kanup kai ja mary long mihka, Isu hmat txr jok mihto ateng kakrum ja ny, Pxtkan mih Pawi jak sawn ty ja jak cak yp mina.<verse eid="MRK 14:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 14:17" />Hnakacy jak nʼklxm hka Isu cy kai va tabei prelai jua si hly tym mina. <verse eid="MRK 14:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 14:18" />Misi cy cakhkong tum cym ca va cak hput mihka Isu hmat, “Ang txr ynni hkyp hym, ynni long hai ang hly ca cak tym mih imi jua hmat ap jok ang hym hym,” peipa jok mina.<verse eid="MRK 14:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 14:19" />Tabei si cy ra-ui nohnai va ny, “Txr ang hym hai ma? Pei mih jua mikum jua mih hlx va hmathmat hkam mina.”<verse eid="MRK 14:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 14:20" />Isu hmat misi hkam, “Mi imi cy prelai jua mih long hai ang hly kawi ca cakhkong tym mih imi na. <verse eid="MRK 14:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 14:21" />Baibu luk kei ty hkyp Imi hai Tahi cy htyk hym mikla hym. Pei kapo Imi hai Tahi hym hnap jok mih mi cy rau nga! Mi imi cy nohkeu mihmat hnai alam hym!” peipa jok mina.<verse eid="MRK 14:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Malai Cak</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:26-30">Mahtai 26.26–30</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:14-20">Luka 22.14–20</ref>; <ref loc="1CO 11:23-25">1 Korin 11.23–25</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 14:22" />Isu cy hmat hai tabei si hly kasua ca jak cak mihka, hmat cy paw kom ny txr kalum kly mikum, kom hym htxk bawr htxk bawr mihka, ryk jok tabei si hkam ny, “ca va, mi kom cy ang hai lungnga na,” peipa mina.<verse eid="MRK 14:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 14:23" />Hnakacy hkap po paw ny, Tamuk hkam txr kalum kly mikum, ryk jok tabei si hkam bei ny, misi byrbyr hkam va mina. <verse eid="MRK 14:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 14:24" />Isu hmat misi hkam, “Mi krip tui cy imi byrbyr si hai kavui kapet mih Tamuk hai ranyk hly kacah typ mih ang hai vi na. <verse eid="MRK 14:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 14:25" />Ang txr ynni hkyp hym, Tamuk hai Pyng mira long hkam krip tui har mih ni notym mih ryk cy, mi krip tui hym ang nohkam bei lyng ky,” peipa jok mina.<verse eid="MRK 14:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 14:26" />Hnakacy hmat hak tabei si cy pahlo txr meng mikum, pxr kai va Olivi hrxng htang mina.<verse eid="MRK 14:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">Petara hai Kala hmat hym mih sai Isu Txr ty yp Mih</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:31-35">Mahtai 26.31–35</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:31-34">Luka 22.31–34</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 13:36-38">Johan 13.36–38</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 14:27" />Isu cy misi hkam, “Baibu hmat txr mih cy, ‘Ang cy beram typ mih jua hym bawm miluk, beram si cy kahpat hpro hym,’ pei kei ty mihto, ynni cy hjy ty ang hym klak ny pjung kai pxn hym. <verse eid="MRK 14:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 14:28" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14.28 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 28:16">Mah 28.16</ref></char></note> Pei kapo ang cy htyk mih long hai rx tyng mikum, Kalile pre htang ynni luk ang kai ri hym,” peipa jok mina.<verse eid="MRK 14:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 14:29" />Petara hmat, “Bet mih byrbyr si hmat yn hym hjy ty klak tok kapo, ang cy ynghak hka po yn hym nohjy ty klak lyng!” peipa jok mina.<verse eid="MRK 14:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 14:30" />Isu hmat Petara, “Ang txr yn hkyp hym, kamai jak kar noka pre kut mih tare yn cy ang notuk pei mih kala ang hym hrum kut hym,” peipa jok mina.<verse eid="MRK 14:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 14:31" />Pei kapo Petara hmat, “Ang cy htyk yn hly tym let tok kapo yn hym ang nokala lyng!” peipa jok hkxn mina.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 14:31">Bet mih tabei byrbyr si hmat po pei txr jok yng mihto tyng ra mina.<verse eid="MRK 14:31" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kethsemani Rakua ko Isu Pycuk Mih</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:36-46">Mahtai 26.36–46</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:39-46">Luka 22.39–46</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 14:32" />Hnakacy Isu hak hamt hai tabei si cy, katym va Kethsemani pei mih rakua tum mina. Isu hmat tabei si hkam, “Ang pycuk mih tare cy ming va mitum rih a!” peipa jok mina. <verse eid="MRK 14:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 14:33" />Hmat cy Petara, Jakob hak Johan si hym hmat hly tym ong hpau ny, pei mihka hmat cy hkri-par ra-ui kaling kamawn mira katym mina. <verse eid="MRK 14:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 14:34" />Hnakacy hmat cy misi hkam, “Ang cy htykvan mipar ra-ui kamawn hnak mina. Ynni cy cami tum ming va sadi hly a,” peipa jok mina.<verse eid="MRK 14:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 14:35" />Hnakacy hmathmat cy, ri htang hmang kai hrawt ny, sakron kung bon luk mihka, hkym man pane cy, y-mi tongnang mira hym nokakrum hym mih pycuk mina. <verse eid="MRK 14:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 14:36" />Hnakacy hmat cy, “Oh pa! Yn cy na conghkang py htai mina. Cami tongnang mira hkap hym ang hkam hai hrxt nang cx a; pei kapo ang hai rahjak nona mihmat, yn hmat hai rahjak ateng na nahky,” pei pycuk mina.<verse eid="MRK 14:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 14:37" />Hnakacy hmat cy hlawi ra tabei hrum jua misi hkam tyng mihka, misi mxi ve kluk mih kakrum miluk Petara hkam, “Simon, yn cy mxi kai vit let ma? Nomxi mihmat nari hlyk par po nohai ming hnak ky ma? <verse eid="MRK 14:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 14:38" />ynni cy parawi mira long hai kahlawi hym mih pycuk mihly ve va. Ra-ui limla hmat cy hra ve kapo, cak-nga cy hra di hym,” peipa jok mina.<verse eid="MRK 14:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 14:39" />Mikum hmat cy kai tyng ny, cxk-ri mihto pycuk bei mina. <verse eid="MRK 14:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 14:40" />Hmathmat cy kut ra tabei hrum jua misi hkam bei ny, misi cy ngyk ve mikmxi mih ki tynglyng bei mina. Misi cy hmat hym napei htim hnai bah, pei mih po notuk va ky.<verse eid="MRK 14:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 14:41" />Mikum hrum mih rx hlawi ra tyng mihka misi hkam, “Ynni cy hmatca hkrai mxi ve jo hin ma? hnai ky rx hai! Ning cy katym ky! jau rih, Imi hai Tahi hym cy imi kamngo si hai rut luk ap hym mih ning katym ra ky. <verse eid="MRK 14:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 14:42" />Rx va hai, hmang i hym ky. Jau rih, hnap jok ang hym mih mi cy katym ra mʼpryn ky!” peipa jok mina.<verse eid="MRK 14:42" /></para>
  <para style="s">Hnap Isu hym Mih</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:47-56">Mahtai 26.47–56</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:47-53">Luka 22.47–53</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:3-12">Johan 18.3–12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 14:43" />Hnakacy Isu cy pei txr ve kly hput mihka, tabei prelai jua mih long hai Juda pei mih tabei jua cy katym ryp mina. Mi hly tym imi mahu si cy nʼdai si, mua si sxn ny ra va mina. Misi cy pahtyp tun lu si, tuk rata mih sara si hak py lu mih katang si hmat hrua mih imi si na. <verse eid="MRK 14:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 14:44" />Hmathmat hym hnap jok mih imi hmat, “Ang hmxk mih imi cy Isu na ky; mi hym hnap ny nokaklong mipar ong kai va,” pei txr jok kahmar-ra hly mina.<verse eid="MRK 14:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="MRK 14:45" />Hnakacy Juda cy katym mihly kai Isu hkam prawt ny, “Malai,!” peipa mihly hmxk Isu hym mina. <verse eid="MRK 14:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MRK 14:46" />Pei mihka imi si cy Isu hym hnap ny cai va mina. <verse eid="MRK 14:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MRK 14:47" />Pei kapo Isu ken jyng ve mih imi jua cy juk nʼdai mihka, pahtyp tun mang hai malu jua hym hteu ny taram kaprai kai tut mina. <verse eid="MRK 14:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MRK 14:48" />Isu hmat misi hkam, “Ynni cy hnap damra hym mihto sxn nʼdai si, mua si mihka ra ang hym hnap let ma?. <verse eid="MRK 14:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="MRK 14:49" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14.49 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 19:47">Luk 19.47</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:37">21.37</ref></char></note>Ang cy Kacukim ko kxp-rani txr riu kly mihka ynni cy nohnap ang hym be. Pei kapo cami cy Baibu hai klysai kangxm ca-hkyp hai ky,” peipa jok mina.<verse eid="MRK 14:49" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="MRK 14:50" />Hnakacy tabei byrbyr si cy hmathmat hym hjy ty klak ny pjung kai va pxn mina.<verse eid="MRK 14:50" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="MRK 14:51" />Pei mihka kato jua cy hkuk vansin mihly pliu Isu kung ny, kawt mih imi si hmat cy mi hym lan va hnap mina. <verse eid="MRK 14:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="MRK 14:52" />Pei kapo mimi cy vansin hym hklxt ty klak ny, pjung kai cak-set hmat klai mina.<verse eid="MRK 14:52" /></para>
  <para style="s">Isu hym Ong Tara Jung Mih</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:57-68">Mahtai 26.57–68</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:54">Luka 22.54</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 22:55">55</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 22:63-71">63–71</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:13">Johan 18.13</ref>,<ref loc="JHN 18:14">14</ref>,<ref loc="JHN 18:19-24">19–24</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="MRK 14:53" />Hnakacy misi cy Isu hym ong kai Pahtyp mih tum mang hai kim ko ny, pahtyp tun mang si, py lu mih katang si hak tuk Rata mih sara si cy kapluk ra va mina. <verse eid="MRK 14:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="MRK 14:54" />Petara cy nokahly nʼhtxng mitum hai kaso pahtyp tun Mang hai kim rakua ko katym mipar, jy kajun hmat kung ny, congkang mih hemi si hly tym cym hkawp ve hmai mina. <verse eid="MRK 14:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="MRK 14:55" />Pahtyp tun lu si hak Cet tara mih tun byrbyr si cy Isu hkam pahtyk hym mih hau aprek tok kapo nasai sasi po noki va mina. <verse eid="MRK 14:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="MRK 14:56" />Imi rahjak jua mih imi si hmat po, nokai rui mih rangho kly hly jyng va sasi mina. Pei kapo misi hai txr mih sai si cy hlyk po kaklxp mih nove.<verse eid="MRK 14:56" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="MRK 14:57" />Kawt mih imi si cy rx ny, nokairui mih rangho kly hly pacawi va mih cy, <verse eid="MRK 14:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="MRK 14:58" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14.58 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 2:19">Jhn 2.19</ref></char></note>“Mi cy ‘Imi hai rut hly py mih cami Kacukim hym cy anghmat hlat kai vit hym ny; imi hai rut hly nopy mih Kacukim hym hrum ni mih tare ang py tyng hym,’ hmathmat pei txr mih kly hym i cy tuk,” pei katxr va mina. <verse eid="MRK 14:58" /><verse number="59" style="v" sid="MRK 14:59" />Pei kapo misi txr mih sasi cy hlyk po nona hkyp va.<verse eid="MRK 14:59" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="60" style="v" sid="MRK 14:60" />Hnakacy Pahtyp tun Mang cy imi mahu si tare jyng ny Isu hkam, “Imi si hmat yng mitan pacawi txr yn hym mih cy, yn cy nasai po noklau mihmat ve hym ky ma?” pei hlx jok mina.<verse eid="MRK 14:60" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="61" style="v" sid="MRK 14:61" />Pei kapo Isu cy kly nuk po nohtim mihmat kamxp ve sim mina. Hnakacy Pahtyp tun mang hmat, “Yn cy rau hnai mih Tamuk hai Tahi Messiah ma?” pei hlx mina.<verse eid="MRK 14:61" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="62" style="v" sid="MRK 14:62" />Isu hmat, “Na vyng, imi hai Tahi cy na conghkang Py htai mih tun hai at htang cym mihly nua nxi htang hai kaso hpum tako hly kahtxp ra mih ynni ki hym!” peipa jok mina.<verse eid="MRK 14:62" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="63" style="v" sid="MRK 14:63" />Pei mihka Pahtyp tun Mang cy hmat hai lungki hym htek prek ny, “I cy yng na mih sasi si hia bei hin va!? <verse eid="MRK 14:63" /><verse number="64" style="v" sid="MRK 14:64" />Mi hai txr cyk Tamuk hym mih cy ynni tuk byr ky. Ynni napei kako hym va?” pei hlx mina.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 14:64">Misi byrbyr hmat Mi cy py tahmang miluk pahtyk hym mih katai pei txr va byr mina.<verse eid="MRK 14:64" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="65" style="v" sid="MRK 14:65" />Kawt mih imi si cy Isu hym htawk kria tui mikum mum mikna mihka hmat hym tahpok va ny, “Yn hym miva tahpok bah txr lym rih!” peipa va mina. Congkang mih hemi si hmat po hmat hym hpau kai ny bawm bek va mina.<verse eid="MRK 14:65" /></para>
  <para style="s">Petara Kala Isu hym Mih</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:69-75">Mahtai 26.69–75</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:56-62">Luka 22.56–62</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:15-18">Johan 18.15–18</ref>,<ref loc="JHN 18:25-27">25–27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="66" style="v" sid="MRK 14:66" />Pei mihka Petara cy cym ve kim rakua ko mihka, Pahtyp tun mang hai cinrx kacai jua cy ra ny, <verse eid="MRK 14:66" /><verse number="67" style="v" sid="MRK 14:67" />Petara hkawp ve hmai mih ki kacy, jau hxrcxng ny, “Yn po Nazaret mary mih Isu hly ve tym mih mi be!” peipa jok mina.<verse eid="MRK 14:67" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="68" style="v" sid="MRK 14:68" />Pei kapo Petara hmat, “Yn hai txr mih cy ang notuk keng, tuk po notuk,” pei kala mihly rakua ko hai cawn kai kacy kar ka ryp mina.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">14.68 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Kawt mih kei ty rut hly mih ca-uk si luk cy </char><char style="fq" closed="false">kar ka ryp mina, </char><char style="ft" closed="false">pei mih nove.</char></note><verse eid="MRK 14:68" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="69" style="v" sid="MRK 14:69" />Hnakacy cinrx kacai jua cy Petara hym kakrum bei ny, jyng ve ken mih imi si hkam, “Mi imi cy misi hai rawi jua na!” peipa jok bei mina. <verse eid="MRK 14:69" /><verse number="70" style="v" sid="MRK 14:70" />Pei kapo Petara cy kala tynglyng bei mina.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 14:70">Hnakacy nokakra mih tare, jyng ve hmat ken mih imi si hmat Petara hkam, “Yn cy Kalile imi na, misi hly karawi mih imi na hkyp be,” peipa jok bei mina.<verse eid="MRK 14:70" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="71" style="v" sid="MRK 14:71" />Pei kapo Petara hmat, “Ang txr rui hkyp hai ky! Ynni txr mih imi hym ang notuk! Ang py rangho let kacy Tamuk hmat ang hym pajeng nahky!” pei kabak ty mina.<verse eid="MRK 14:71" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="72" style="v" sid="MRK 14:72" />Mikum mua kacy kar-jang kai ryp ky. Pei mihka, “Kar noka pre kut mih tare ang hym yn kala hrum kut hym,” Pei mih Isu hmat txr ty mih klysai hym Petara cy man sadi vau miluk, hrak kahma ny rongpang ei mina.<verse eid="MRK 14:72" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="MRK 15" />
  <para style="s">Isu hym Ong Pilata hkam Mih</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:1">Mahtai 27.1</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 27:2">2</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 27:11-14">11–14</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:1-5">Luka 23.1–5</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:28-38">Johan 18.28–38</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 15:1" />Ngxr hmxrkling hka pahtyp tun lu si, tuk Rata mih sara si, py lu mih katang si hak Cet tara mih tun si hly kahlx va rahret ny pahtyk hym mih karam va mina. Mi kum Isu hym cai mihka, ong hpau kai ny ap jok Pilata hkam mina. <verse eid="MRK 15:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 15:2" />Pei mihka Pilata hmat mi hkam, “Yn cy Juda si hai sangmrang ma?” pei hlx jok mina.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 15:2">Isu hmat, “Yn hmat txr mih ateng na hkyp ky,” peipa jok mina.<verse eid="MRK 15:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 15:3" />Pahtyp tun lu si cy, Isu hym pacawi va amjyamjy mina. <verse eid="MRK 15:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 15:4" />Hnakacy Pilata hmat Isu hkam, “Jau rih! Yn hym yngmi tan tang aprek mih cy nasai po yn nohtim hnak hym ky ma?” peipa jok mina.<verse eid="MRK 15:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 15:5" />Isu cy nasai po nohtim tyng miluk ny, Pilata cy lx hnak mina.<verse eid="MRK 15:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Pahtyk Isu hym Mih Kla Amik Mih</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:15-26">Mahtai 27.15–26</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:13-25">Luka 23.13–25</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:39-19:16">Johan 18.39—19.16</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 15:6" />Pilata cy Pxtkan mih Pawi katym mih teng, imi mahu si hmat leng mih htong sa jua hym pahlawi jok mih ve reng mina. <verse eid="MRK 15:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 15:7" />Pei mihtxm hka pre pyng mih tun si hym tu ny, pahtyk imi hym mih ahmu luk vyng htong mih imi si ve mina. Misi long Barabba pei mih imi po ve jua mina. <verse eid="MRK 15:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 15:8" />Pei mihka imi mahu si cy pawi ni hka py rengreng mihto leng hym mih kapluk tym va Pilata hkam mina. <verse eid="MRK 15:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 15:9" />Pei mihka Pilata hmat, “Ynni cy pahlawi Juda sangmrang hym mih hia ma?” pei hlx mina. <verse eid="MRK 15:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 15:10" />Pahtyp tun lu si cy Isu hym nohia va jau miluk ny ap jok hmat hkam hai pei mih, Pilata cy tuk miluk na.<verse eid="MRK 15:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 15:11" />Pei kapo pahtyp tun lu si hmat Isu hai klyn, pahlawi Barabba hym mih imi mahu si hym cxk ty mina. <verse eid="MRK 15:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 15:12" />Pilata hmat, “Juda si hai sangmrang, ynni pei hpau mih mi hym ang napei pyk na hym va?” pei hlx jok mina.<verse eid="MRK 15:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 15:13" />Imi mahu si hmat, “Mi hym tak ty hkraws luk!” pei ot va mina.<verse eid="MRK 15:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 15:14" />Hnakacy Pilata hmat, “Napei mih, mi cy py ty na kamngo misai va?” pei hlx jok mina.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 15:14">Imi si cy, “Mi hym cy tak ty hkraws luk ny pahtyk kai vit!” pei ot va ratrat mina.<verse eid="MRK 15:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 15:15" />Pilata cy imi mahu si hai rahjak hym jua jok miluk pahlawi Barabba hym ny, Isu hym cy bawm hta mikum tak ty hkraws luk hym mih ap jok mina.<verse eid="MRK 15:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Hemi si hmat Hplat Isu hym Mih</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:27-31">Mahtai 27.27–31</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:2">Johan 19.2</ref>,<ref loc="JHN 19:3">3</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 15:16" />Pei mihka hemi si cy hmat hym ong kai pyng mih tun makye hai kim rakua ko ny, he tangrxp dyk hym hkxng hpau mina. <verse eid="MRK 15:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 15:17" />Misi cy Isu hym hkuk jok nung mih lungki hur ny, nʼcu hring hly kui ty mih lumum po krong jok hmat hai lu nxi mina. <verse eid="MRK 15:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 15:18" />Hnakacy, “Juda si hai Sangmrang, dung klang nahky!”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">15.18 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">dung klang nahky; </char><char style="ft" closed="false">kawt mih kei ty rut hly mih ca-uk si luk cy </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">rau hnai nahky, </char><char style="ft" closed="false">pei mih ve mina.</char></note> pei hplat ren va mina. <verse eid="MRK 15:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 15:19" />Hnakacy lu hym bawm hta mua hly mikum, htok kria tui hly ny, hmat nga sakron kung mihka cuk mina. <verse eid="MRK 15:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 15:20" />Pei hplat ren va mikum nung mih lungki hur cy hklxt jok vit ny, kahlong jok hmat hai lungki hur tyng. Hnakacy misi cy hmat hym tak ty hkraws luk hym mih ong hpau kai va mina.<verse eid="MRK 15:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Isu hym Tak Hkraws Mih</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:32-44">Mahtai 27.32–44</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:26-43">Luka 23.26–43</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:17-27">Johan 19.17–27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 15:21" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">15.21 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ROM 16:13">Rom 16.13</ref>
      </char>
    </note> Pei mihka (Kurini mary mih Aleksanda mija Rufu hai kapa,) Simon cy kale nam htang hai katym ra mina. He si hmat mi hym hpau hkekan ny, kawt jok Isu hai hkraws hym mina. <verse eid="MRK 15:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 15:22" />Hnakacy Isu hym ong kai Kolkohta pei hpau mih tym tum mina. Kolkohta pei mih cy, “Lu hut tym,” pei misai na. <verse eid="MRK 15:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 15:23" />Misi cy murra hly mua ty mih krip jutui hym ngok jok hmat hym mina. Pei kapo Isu cy nohkam jok. <verse eid="MRK 15:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 15:24" />Misi cy hmat hym tak ty hkraws luk mina. Hmat hai hkuk-xk si hym po, var tamcum ny karet va mina. <verse eid="MRK 15:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 15:25" />Hmat hym tak ty hkraws luk ny pahtyk mih ning cy ngxr htang ve ku nari bah mina. <verse eid="MRK 15:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 15:26" />Hmat hym cang aprek mih ca dang ty hkraws luk mih cy, “Juda si hai sangmrang,” pei mina. <verse eid="MRK 15:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 15:27" />Damra pre jua hym po Isu hly tym at htang jua, kua htang jua tak ty hkraws luk mina. <verse eid="MRK 15:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" pubnumber="[28]" sid="MRK 15:28" /><note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">15.28 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Kawt mih kei ty rut hly mih ca-uk si luk cy cem 28: </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Hmat cy imi kamngo si hym rep milong kabua ky, pei mih baibu klysai cy kangxm ky, </char><char style="ft" closed="false">(jau </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="LUK 22:37">Luk 22.37</ref></char>).</note><verse eid="MRK 15:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 15:29" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">15.29</char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MRK 14:58">Mrk 14.58</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 2:19">Jhn 2.19</ref></char>
    </note> Kaving ve mʼhma mih imi si hmat po ngxt jok lu mihly, “Eh! Kacukim hym hlat ny, hrum ni tare py tyng mih mi!, <verse eid="MRK 15:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 15:30" />Hkraws luk hai kahtxp ra ny, yn hmat hmat kaklang pade!” pei hplat ren va Isu hym mina.<verse eid="MRK 15:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 15:31" />Yngmihto tyng pahtyp tun lu si hak tuk Rata mih sara si po hplat ren va mina. “Mi imi cy bet mih imi si hym cy kaklang ny, hmathmat cy nohai kaklang be! <verse eid="MRK 15:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 15:32" />Isarel sangmrang, Messiah cy hkraws luk hai kahtxp ra nahky; kahtxp mih ki kacy i yb hym htung!” pei mih hmatva tingtawi txr mihly hplat ren va mina.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 15:32">Isu hly tym katak ve hkraws luk mih pre jua mija po Isu hym hplat ren ja mina.<verse eid="MRK 15:32" /></para>
  <para style="s">Isu Htyk Mih</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:45-56">Mahtai 27.45–56</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:44-49">Luka 23.44–49</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:28-30">Johan 19.28–30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 15:33" />Rasa nxi hpxng mihka hai kaso rasa nge hrum nari hkrai, bonpre dyk mu ciu hnak mina. <verse eid="MRK 15:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 15:34" />Rasa nge hrum nari mih ning hka Isu cy, “Eloi, Eloi, Lama Sabakhtani?” pei ot mina. Y-mi cy, “Ang hai Tamuk, napei ty ang hym klak let ma?” pei mih sai na.<verse eid="MRK 15:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 15:35" />Jyng ve ken mih kawt mih imi si cy pei mih kly hym tuk kacy, “Jau va rih, mi cy hpau Elija hym ky!” pei txr va mina. <verse eid="MRK 15:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 15:36" />Pei mihka imi jua cy pjung kai ny, paw tuinawi rutbum bxk mihka hur-prat mih krip ju kanup jep mipar bit ty mikum kak ty mua luk ny, hkam jok Isu hym mina. Hnakacy misi cy, “Elija cy paw hmathmat hym mih hkym ra bah, nora bah jau i lym rih!” pei txr va mina.<verse eid="MRK 15:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 15:37" />Hnakacy Isu cy hra hra hmat ot lap mihly htyk kai mina.<verse eid="MRK 15:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 15:38" />Kacukim ko mih kalaka cy, nxi htang hai kaso kly htang hkrai kahtek kai pre htang mina. <verse eid="MRK 15:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 15:39" />Jyng ve hkraws hai nga htang mih he lu cy Isu htyk kai mih<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">15.39 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">htyk kai mih; </char><char style="ft" closed="false">kawt mih kei ty rut hly mih ca-uk si luk cy </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">lap mihly htyk kai, </char><char style="ft" closed="false">pei ve mina.</char></note> ki mihka, “Mi imi cy Tamuk hai Tahi na hkyp ky!” pei txr mina.<verse eid="MRK 15:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 15:40" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">15.40,41 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LUK 8:2">Luk 8.2</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 8:3">3</ref></char>
    </note> Kawt mih kacai si cy hla htang hai kaso kadyng jau va mina. Misi long Makadala mary mih Mari, Jakob le hak Josehpa hai kanu mari hak, Salomi po pa ria mina. <verse eid="MRK 15:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 15:41" />Misi cy Isu ve Kalile pre mihtxm hka, kajun hmat kung ny, hking ngok hmathmat hym reng mih kacai si na. Mikum hmathmat hly tym kajun Jerusalem mary mih bet mih kacai si po ve ria mina.<verse eid="MRK 15:41" /></para>
  <para style="s">Isu hym Hpum Mih</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:57-61">Mahtai 27.57–61</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:50-56">Luka 23.50–56</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:38-42">Johan 19.38–42</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 15:42" />Y-mi ni cy Kanawn ni nokatym cx mih, Katym yp mih ni na ny, jak htang nʼklxm hka, Arimahtai mary mih Josehpa cy katym ra mina. <verse eid="MRK 15:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 15:43" />Mi cy Tara jung hai tamu ve kyk mih Arimate mary mih Josehpa cy, Tamuk hai Pyng mira katym hym pei ny, ming ve yp mih Arimate mary mih imi na. Mi cy kai Pilata hkam ny, vam prai mihly Isu hai vak hym leng mina. <verse eid="MRK 15:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 15:44" />Pilata cy Isu htyk kai vit ryp mih tuk mihka kacy hkri-par lx hnak ny, hpau he lu hym mihka, Isu htyk mih cy kakra yng natan ky va, pei hlx mina. <verse eid="MRK 15:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MRK 15:45" />He lu hai kamtei jok mih kly hym tuk mihka, Pilata cy Josehpa hym paw vak hym mih jok mina. <verse eid="MRK 15:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MRK 15:46" />Hnakacy Josehpa cy ran piksa har mihka, hkraws luk hai vak hym paw ny, y-mi piksa hly pau ty ky. Hnakacy hua hym uk ty hpuk mih klan kom ko ty ty mina. Mikum klan plot tum pleng ty hualung top mina. <verse eid="MRK 15:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MRK 15:47" />Makadala mary mih Mari hak Josehpa hai kanu Mari mija cy Isu hai vak hym hpum ham mitum bah pei mih ki ja mina.<verse eid="MRK 15:47" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="MRK 16" />
  <para style="s">Htyk Mira hai Rx tyng Mih</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 28:1-8">Mahtai 28.1–8</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 24:1-12">Luka 24.1–12</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 20:1-10">Johan 20.1–10</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 16:1" />Kanawn ni kum, Makadala mary mih Mari, Jakob hai kanu Mari mija hak Salomi si cy pahtxm Isu hai vak hym mih kai va rimui si ran mina. <verse eid="MRK 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 16:2" />Hnakacy talangkuni ni, ngxr hmxrkling rasa lot mih ning hka, misi cy kai va klan mina. <verse eid="MRK 16:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 16:3" />Misi cy, “Klan kom plot bing ty mih hualung hym miva hkym pleng nang hym va?” pei mih mʼhma yh hmatva tingtawi karam va mina. <verse eid="MRK 16:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 16:4" />Mi hualung cy hkri-par kye hnak mina. Hnakacy misi katym ny jau va mihka, hualung cy kapleng kai yp mih ki va let mina. <verse eid="MRK 16:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 16:5" />Hnakacy misi kanup jau va klan hpuk ko mihka, kahlong lungki hur kok mih kato jua cy cym ve at htang mih ki va miluk, katyr va mina.<verse eid="MRK 16:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 16:6" />Pei kapo mi hmat, “Bongpa katyr va, tak ty hkraws luk mih Nazaret Isu hym ynni hau hai hna; mi cy nove cami tum lyng ky. Mi cy htyk mih tum hai rx tyng vit ky! Jau rih, mitum cy hmat hai vak hym lang ty mih tym na. <verse eid="MRK 16:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 16:7" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16.7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 26:32">Mah 26.32</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:28">Mrk 14.28</ref></char></note>Ynni cy Petara hak bet mih tabei si hkam kai ny, hmathmat cy ynni hai ri htang katym kai Kalile pre yp vit ky. Txr ty ynni hkam yp mih ateng, ‘Hmathmat hym cy kakrum Kalile pre hym hmang pei txr jok a,’ ” peipa jok mina.<verse eid="MRK 16:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 16:8" />Hnakacy kacai si cy katyr kram mihly, klan hai pjung ra va mina. Misi cy kram miluk mimi hkam po notxr jok va.</para>
  <para style="ms" vid="MRK 16:8">Prim Mih Satang Hnai Txt Mira Hlyk<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">16.8 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Kawt mih kei ty rut hly mih ca-uk si luk cy Satang hnai hai txt ty mih (cem 9–20) nove.</char></note></para>
  <para style="mr" vid="MRK 16:8">
    <ref loc="MRK 16:9-20">16.9–20</ref></para>
  <para style="s" vid="MRK 16:8">Makadala Mari hkam Katxng jok Mih</para>
  <para style="r" vid="MRK 16:8">(<ref loc="MAT 28:9-10">Mahtai 28.9–10</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 20:11-18">Johan 20.11–18</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 16:8">[ <verse eid="MRK 16:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 16:9" />Isu cy talangkuni ni ngxr hmxrkling hka, rx tyng mikum, ri hmat katxng jok Makadala Mary mih Mari hkam mina. Mi Mari cy nopei hka nohnai mih limla-ui ranit jua hym hmathmat pahtok jok vit mih kacai na. <verse eid="MRK 16:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 16:10" />Mi kacai cy kai Isu hai rawi si hkam ny, mi satang hym kamtei txr jok ky; pei mihka misi cy ra-ui nohnai ny hraknga ei va mina. <verse eid="MRK 16:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 16:11" />Pei kapo Isu cy hring tyng pei mih, Mari cy hmathmat hym kakrum hpyk mih sai txr jok kapo misi cy noyb va.<verse eid="MRK 16:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Tabei Prejua hkam Isu Katxng jok Mih</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 24:13-35">Luka 24.13–35</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 16:12" />Mikum tabei prejua cy kalei nam htang kai ja pin mihka, Isu cy hmat hai tung klang pet kai vit mihly mija mih prejua hkam katxng jok mina. <verse eid="MRK 16:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 16:13" />Mija cy hlawi ny mi satang hym bet mih tabei si hkam kamtei txr jok mina. Pei kapo misi cy noyb va.<verse eid="MRK 16:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Tabei Hlyklai jua si hkam Isu Katxng jok Mih</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 28:16-20">Mahtai 28.16–20</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 24:36-49">Luka 24.36–49</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 20:19-23">Johan 20.19–23</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 1:6-8">Rahmang 1.6–8</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 16:14" />Hnakacy hlyklaijua mih tabei si cy cym ca va cak hput mihka, Isu cy misi hkam katxng jok mina. Misi cy rx tyng mih hmathmat hym kakrum mih si hai kly hym noyb miluk, misi hai noyb mih ra-ui pumpau mihym, hmathmat cy misi hym pring ngak mina. <verse eid="MRK 16:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 16:15" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16.15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 1:8">Rah 1.8</ref></char></note>Hnakacy Isu hmat misi hkam, “Ynni cy bonpre dyk kai ny, ang py mih imi byrbyr si hkam Satang Hnai hym kamhtang jok va. <verse eid="MRK 16:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 16:16" />Yb ny, man baptisma mih imi si hnget cy man kaklangra hym; noyb mih imi si hnget cy cet tara mira kakrum hym. <verse eid="MRK 16:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 16:17" />Yb mih imi si cy ringrang si py htai hym. Ang hai ming hly limla-ui si hym po pahtok va hym; kly har si po txr va hym. <verse eid="MRK 16:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 16:18" />Rua nga si hym po hai hnap hym, htyk jok htai mih rahtyk pram hlykhlyk hkam jok tok kapo, rai mira kakrum hym mih nona. Rau mih imi si hkam klyng rut mihly rau hnai jok hym,” peipa jok mina.<verse eid="MRK 16:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Isu Cyng Pxr Lamuk Htang Mih</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 24:50-53">Luka 24.50–53</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 1:9-11">Rahmang 1.9–11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 16:19" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">16.19 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ACT 1:9-11">Rah 1.9–11</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Hnakacy Malai Isu cy pei txr misi hkam mikum, hmat cy cyng pxr kai lamuk nam htang ny, cym ve Tamuk hai at htang mina. <verse eid="MRK 16:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 16:20" />Pei mihka tabei si cy kai kxp tymkor tum ny, ho va mina. Malai cy misi hly tym py tok ny, misi hai txr mih kly cy rui, pei tuk jok hym mih ringrang si katxng jok mina.]</para>
  <para style="ms" vid="MRK 16:20">Bet Prim Mih Kly Txt Sai<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">16.20 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Kawt mih kei ty rut hly mih ca-uk si luk cy txt ty lui hly mikum klang hly po txt ty mih ve mina (cem 9–20).</char></note></para>
  <para style="mr" vid="MRK 16:20">
    <ref loc="MRK 16:9-10">16.9–10</ref></para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 16:20">[ <verse eid="MRK 16:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" pubnumber="[9]" sid="MRK 16:21" /> Kacai si cy kai va Petara hak tabei si hkam ny, misi hkam txr jok mih si hnget cy kamtei jok pxn mina. <verse eid="MRK 16:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" pubnumber="[10]" sid="MRK 16:22" /> Hnakacy Isu cy hmathmat hai tabei si hym, nʼlot htang hai kaso nʼiu htang hkrai hrua ny; dungjan kaklangra klysai cy kahpat jok mina.]<verse eid="MRK 16:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 16" />
</usx>